Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:17.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm sittir on top of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yes, rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:27.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I'm quittir the blues of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:30.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm singir a song. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:33.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yes, singir a song. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:36.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Glory hallelujah! I just told the parson. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:39.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Hey, Par, get ready to call. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:40.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Just like Hunpty Dunpty. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm gonna fall. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:48.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I'm sittir on top of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:51.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Don't want any nillions. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:59.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm gettir ny share. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I've only got one suit just one. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ That's all I can wear. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:06.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ A bundle of noney. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:09.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Don't nake ne feel gay. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:11.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ A sweet little honey. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:15.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Is naking ne say. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I'm sittir, sittir on top, top of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:30.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ And I'm quittir quittir the blues blues of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:32.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm singir a song. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:35.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yes, singir a song. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:38.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Glory hallelujah! I just told the parson. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:41.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Hey, Par, get ready to call. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Just like Hunpty Dunpty. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm gonna fall. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:50.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Yeah! I'm sittir on top, top of the world. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ I'm rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Rollir along. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a funny one. Isn't that funnier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:11.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's hysterical, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:12.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as we're laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we won't cry over the box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:15.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Talk about depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:19.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty girls in feather boas prancing around like circus ponies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:21.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I love a good chorus line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's this?   - It's a play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who wrote it, Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some guy. Driscoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:33.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Driscoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,From the Federal Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:38.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't knock it, honey. At least they got an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:42.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll pick up. Isn't that right, Manny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:49.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:53.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The trick is to start to build right from the back of your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Works well out through the nose, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry. Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:04.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, take me to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:12.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:16.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You think the kitchen will still be open on Third?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soup and biscuits. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Harry, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:32.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, open up! We work here.   - Not anymore, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right for you. We haven't had a paycheck in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How we gonna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:40.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're not getting away with this!   - They just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:46.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The show, it's over. It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:48.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:56.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:58.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:01.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were small, people been letting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:10.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta think of yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You should try out for that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:18.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:22.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Every time you reach out for something you care about...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,fate comes along and snatches it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But not this time, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:30.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, hello, Mr. Weston.   - Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:40.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, miss, I told you already, call my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:42.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave your resume with my secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:45.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, why would I want to do that when we can talk about it in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because that's what a smart girl would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:50.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But I already sent you my resume. You returned it unopened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What can I say? Jack Driscoll's very particular about who he works with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:55.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, just an audition. That's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, you don't give up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:57.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Weston, I know this role backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:00.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad, 'cause we just gave the part to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, kid. The play is cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know times are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want my advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:14.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Use what you got. You're not bad-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A girl like you doesn't have to starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:22.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a new place. It just opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now listen, princess, this gig ain't the Palace, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:33.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ask for Kenny K. Tell him I sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:37.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just play the date, take the money...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,forget you was ever there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:12.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How much more is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:14.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Another five reels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is what we get for our $40,000, Denam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:29.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Another one of your safari pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You promised us romantic scenes with Bruce Baxter and Maureen McKenzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:33.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You promised us romantic scenes with Bruce Baxter and Maureen McKenzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellows, you know the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We agreed to push Maureers start date...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so she could get her teeth fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not the principle of the thing, it's the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl, you've been in production for over two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:46.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Bruce and Maureen are gonna steam up the screen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:48.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,once we get them on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The one that we hired to get to the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What location? Carl! You're supposed to be shooting on the back lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:01.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But, fellows, we're not making that film anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:02.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The story has changed. The script has been rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Life intervened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:11.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've come into possession of a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:15.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The sole surviving record of an uncharted island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:18.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A place that was thought to exist only in myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Carl, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he asking for more money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's asking us to fund a wild-goose chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:30.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a primitive world never before seen by man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:35.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The ruins of an entire civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:39.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The most spectacular thing you've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:42.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's where I'll shoot my picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will there be boobies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Boobies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:52.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jigglies. Jiblonkas. Bazooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In my experience, people only go to these films...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:59.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to observe the undraped form of the native girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you, an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:04.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You think they asked De Mille if he would waste his time on nudie shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! They respected the filmmaker. They showed some class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:11.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that you'd know what that means, you cheap lowlife!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:18.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you step out for a moment, Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Zelman and Associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:33.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me that, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:37.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You won't like it. It's non-alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:41.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Preston, you have a lot to learn about the motion picture business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:46.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't write him off, fellows. He's hotheaded, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:49.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but Carl Denam's made some interesting pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's had a lot of near-success.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:54.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a preening self-promoter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:58.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,An ambitious no-talent. The guy's got "loser" written all over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:09:59.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand your disappointment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He can't direct. He doesn't have the smarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's washed up. It's all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This jumped-up little turd's gonna bankrupt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The animal footage has value.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure. Universal are desperate for stock footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then sell it! Scrap the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got to retrieve something from this debacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Denam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want the cast and crew on the ship within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Carl, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell them the studio pressured us into an early departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's not ethical!   - What are they gonna do, sue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They can get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let them kill my film.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You realize that none of the camera equipment is on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:46.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have no permits, no visas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why I have you, Preston.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have no insurance, we have no foreign currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact, we have no currency of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:53.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get in there.   - Who's gonna pay for the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:56.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:03.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You get out of there! Come here!   - Step on it! Step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:06.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out! You're finished, Denam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Preston. I've had a lot of practice at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm real good at crapping the crappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Red Label, 80% proof...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:21.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to be packed in a crate marked "lemonade."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:22.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:24.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell Maureen she doesn't have six hours to put on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If she wants to be in this picture, she's gotta be on that boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:30.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She doesn't wanna be in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maureen pulled out.   - She pulled out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yesterday. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You said we were shooting in Singapore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what you told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:43.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we're not shooting in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:48.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God damn it, Preston, all you had to do was look her in the eye and lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got to get to a phone, talk to harlow's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:52.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Myrna Loy? Clara Bow? Mae West?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll never get her into a size four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:12:01.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You gotta get a girl that'll fit into Maureers costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:04.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fay's a size four.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:08.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is, but she's doing a picture with RKO.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:11.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cooper, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:15.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I might have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not listening. We got to delay the shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut production down. We can't sail tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:21.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not an option. Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said I'd find a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For God's sake, Preston, think like a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:28.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Call Jack. I need that goddamn screenplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:32.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Defeat is always momentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! You gonna pay for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:12.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, I think you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Vaudeville, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I worked vaudeville once. That is a tough audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you don't kill them fast, they kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:30.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Denam...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:35.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that I'm not in the habit of accepting charity from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or, for that matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,taking things that don't belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was obviously a terrible misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that I haven't been paid in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:47.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's awful. Anyway, Ann... May I call you Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:53.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be a size four, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no. Oh, God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:00.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got me all wrong. Miss Darrow, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not that type of person at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What type of person are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm someone you can trust, Ann. I'm a movie producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:11.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I am on the level. No funny business. Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:19.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, I want you to imagine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,a handsome explorer bound for the Far East.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:28.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're filming in the Far East?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,On board ship, he meets a mysterious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's beautiful, she's fragile, haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And she can't escape the feeling that forces beyond her control...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:46.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,are compelling her down a road from which she cannot draw back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:50.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's as if her whole life has been a prelude to this moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:56.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,this fateful meeting that changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:00.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And sure enough, against her better judgment...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She falls in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:06.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But she doesn't trust it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not even sure if she believes in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:12.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If she loves someone, it's doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good things never last, Mr. Denam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:28.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're interested. Good. That's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:31.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I don't wanna rush you, but we are under some time pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:33.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, I really...   - Ann, I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you're perfect. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the saddest girl I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:41.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make them weep, Ann. You're gonna break their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See, that's where you're wrong, Mr. Denam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I make people laugh, that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck with your picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:55.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann? Miss Darrow, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm offering you money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:17:00.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Adventure, fame, the thrill of a lifetime, and a long sea voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.61,0:17:01.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want to read a script?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack Driscoll's turning in a draft as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack Driscoll?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:09.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, not personally. I've seen his plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:18.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What a writer, huh? And let me tell you, Ann...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:21.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack Driscoll does not want just anyone starring in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:22.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He said to me, "Carl...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:26.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,somewhere out there is a woman born to play this role."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I saw you, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was always going to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How much do I owe you?   - Make it a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this the moving picture ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's actually this one over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:15.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let appearances deceive you. It's much more spacious on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is this all of the equipment?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:20.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is all of it?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:21.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're taking the Bell & howell?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:24.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good. You got all the lenses?   - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:26.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Carl!   - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get it on board, fellows.   - come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's bad, it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:35.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're on their way. I've just had word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:37.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who?   - Men in uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:39.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The studio called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Englehorn! Cast off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hoist up the mainsail, raise the anchor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,whatever the hell it is you do. We gotta leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are waiting on the manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What? Who? English, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Paperwork, Mr. Denam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give you another $1,000 to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You haven't given me the first $1,000 yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:08.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't you see we're in the company of a VIP guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:17.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann Darrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So you are ready for this voyage, Miss Darrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nervous? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:34.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why? Should I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It isn't every woman who would take such a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:43.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't I show Miss Darrow to her cabin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:46.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wonderful idea. Thank you, Preston.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow, if you would just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:54.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,hi. My name is Preston. Carl's assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,$2,000. It's a deal. Will you take a check?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If there's anything that you... Excuse me, fellows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:08.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If there's anything that you need, please don't hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:29.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus! Jack, you scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:33.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen. If anyone comes to the door, don't open it. You haven't seen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say I got depressed and committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say I stuck my head down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You want one?   - No. I can't stay, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:45.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a rehearsal for which I am now three hours late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:48.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's this?   - It's the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a script?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:55.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack, this is 15 pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:58.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, but they're good. You've got 15 good pages there, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:00.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be making a feature-length picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You told me I had more time. I'm sorry. Look, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:05.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Jack, you can't do this to me. I have a beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:07.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I need a middle and an end. I gotta have something to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:11.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, you got my notes. I got to go, pal. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:18.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, fine. We might as well settle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna stiff a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:28.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've never known you to volunteer cash before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How's $2,000 sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:34.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought it might.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:37.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sounds great.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Raise the spring line!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch the aft!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:53.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've written "two grand."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So I did. Sorry about that. Let's start from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:07.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Two thousand dollars."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:17.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is the 29th, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, it's the 25th. It's the 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God, I'm sorry. It'll just take a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Carl. Just pay me when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.81,0:22:26.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.59,0:22:42.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your cabin is the last on the left, Mr. Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:47.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And may I just say how excited we are to have you back with us, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:49.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be a sport and lend a hand here, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'm trying to... I gotta get...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:55.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:58.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Appreciate the help, fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:23:00.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me get the door for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:03.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to your stateroom, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dead slow ahead both, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:13.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dead slow ahead both, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:22.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:45.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you, Jack, there's no money in theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:53.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're much better off sticking with film.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:56.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't do it for the money, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I happen to love the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:02.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.47,0:24:05.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you really loved it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:07.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you would have jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:13.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You! This is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:30.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This room very comfortable. Plenty dim light, fresh straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.83,0:24:32.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus. What do you keep down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:35.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lion, tiger, hippo, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You sell them to zoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:39.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Zoo, circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:42.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Skipper get big money for rare animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.74,0:24:45.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Careful. Camel have bad accident on floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.05,0:24:47.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stain unremovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:53.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Skipper catch any wild animal you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll do you real good price on white rhino.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Choy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:02.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My apologies for not being able to offer you a cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you found an enclosure to your taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:07.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Spoiled for choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:10.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you, Mr. Driscoll? A lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:13.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or a chimpanzee?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.61,0:25:16.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.19,0:25:30.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you to lock it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:34.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sorry, Skipper. Lumpy said...   - Lumpy doesn't give the orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.53,0:25:37.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do? Put the whole ship to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:42.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.77,0:26:20.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Compliments of the chef.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:28.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Christ. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:31.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lamb's brains in walnut sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.69,0:26:37.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:40.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You run those ropes up on deck like I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:42.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Doing it now, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:46.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How about you return Mr. Driscoll's pen first?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.11,0:26:55.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He don't mean no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:57.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:26:59.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll keep him out of your way.   - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.88,0:27:02.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that he likes it down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:05.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's where I found him four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:08.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stowed away in one of them back cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:11.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His arm was broken in two places.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:15.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was wilder than half the animals in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:19.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Still won't tell me where he came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.47,0:27:22.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But it wasrt anyplace good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.27,0:27:27.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got to straighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:28.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:32.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be on this ship the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I do.   - No, you don't, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got to be smart. Get yourself educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give yourself some options. Take this seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.59,0:27:41.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do, Mr. Hayes, I do. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:43.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:47.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I borrowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:54.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,On long-term loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.27,0:27:56.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at this. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.77,0:28:00.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Adventures on a tramp steamer." See? Just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.11,0:28:09.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so nice to meet you, Mr. Driscoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:13.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm actually quite familiar with your work, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:20.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Driscoll. It's so nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:23.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm quite familiar with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:25.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.87,0:28:27.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've read everything you've ever written.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.87,0:28:29.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:33.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gonna have the ship's engines all over the dialogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seagulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:38.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Camera noise. Wind. Christ knows what else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:39.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:42.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the sound recordist. Make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:46.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann! Come on in. Let me introduce you to the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is herb, the cameraman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.36,0:28:52.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Delighted to meet you, ma'am.   - Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May I say what a lovely dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:57.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, this old thing? I just threw it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:29:00.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one of Maureers costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.67,0:29:04.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, what does a girl have to do around here to get some breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:06.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lumpy, you heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:10.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fancy my porridge a la walnuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:16.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ann, I don't believe you've met...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.19,0:29:20.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:23.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's all right, Mr. Denam. I know who this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:32.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thrilled to meet you. It's an honor to be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.04,0:29:38.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm quite familiar with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:40.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.37,0:29:43.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, and what I most admire...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.51,0:29:47.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is the way you've captured the voice of the common people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.38,0:29:50.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.09,0:29:55.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard this before, Mr. Driscoll...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:56.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind me saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.02,0:30:00.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but you don't look at all like your photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.23,0:30:06.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me.   - Wait a minute, Ann...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.00,0:30:09.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,he's so much younger in person. And much better-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:11.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, stop. Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.57,0:30:13.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, I was just afraid that you might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:16.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,one of those self-obsessed literary types.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.11,0:30:18.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry, I'm not...   - You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:22.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the tweedy twerp with his nose in his book and his head up his a...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:29.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, too, Miss Darrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.00,0:31:12.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's standing at the railing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:14.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know it yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:19.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But they are sailing towards disaster. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.47,0:31:21.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, so she turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the first mate is staggering towards her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:28.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a knife sticking out of his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:31.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. We're killing off the first mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.89,0:31:34.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's assuming she knows who the first mate is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.15,0:31:36.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jack. It was an honest mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.06,0:31:39.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann is nearsighted. It could have happened to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.69,0:31:41.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was joking, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.36,0:31:44.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The point is, she's horrified. She has to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.37,0:31:49.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's when she sees it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:53.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sees what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.31,0:31:55.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.95,0:32:02.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The island.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:10.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're filming on an island now? When did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:13.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:16.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want the crew getting spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.23,0:32:20.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would they get spooked? What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.33,0:32:22.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. It has a local name...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.44,0:32:24.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I'm warning you, Jack, it doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.04,0:32:27.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They call it Skull Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.87,0:32:29.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:31.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:34.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing officially wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.68,0:32:38.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because, technically, it hasn't been discovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.45,0:32:42.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:46.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So we arrive at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:04.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:12.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, from the top! And action!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.69,0:33:17.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think this is awfully exciting! I've never been on a ship before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.42,0:33:20.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I've never been on one with a woman before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:23.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't think much of women on ships, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.93,0:33:25.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, they're a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.67,0:33:27.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll try not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.67,0:33:29.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just being around is trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.61,0:33:38.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:41.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.28,0:33:45.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bruce, wonderful performance. You can relax for 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.59,0:33:48.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was very natural. I felt moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.62,0:33:52.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Driscoll? Dialogue's got some flow now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.19,0:33:54.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was pure effluence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.09,0:33:55.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I beefed up the banter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to resist that impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:00.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just a little bit of humor, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:02.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you, a Bolshevik or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.97,0:34:04.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.30,0:34:08.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Travel the world, but all they ever see is a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.09,0:34:22.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.09,0:34:26.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sea legs. Well, you know, sea legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.36,0:34:33.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that you don't have good legs. Just making conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:36.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus. Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.34,0:34:40.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,About the scene today with you and Bruce...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.94,0:34:42.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it wasrt what you wrote...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:46.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but Mr. Baxter felt very strongly that when a man likes a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.51,0:34:49.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,he must ignore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.25,0:34:52.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And if things turn really hostile, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:54.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.25,0:34:55.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Interesting theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.69,0:34:58.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. I should have...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:01.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It wasrt what I had intended, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:02.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:04.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you made it your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:07.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.43,0:35:10.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It was funny, actually.   - You were funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.00,0:35:13.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't say another word. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.37,0:35:14.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.41,0:35:22.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.39,0:36:37.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:39.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you please... We're trying to shoot a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.49,0:36:41.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay.   - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:42.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:59.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're close. Turn southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:03.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no land southwest for thousands of miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.98,0:37:07.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It takes us way outside the shipping lanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.59,0:37:10.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't sail blind in these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:13.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll make it won'th your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:16.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's nothing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then you've nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.88,0:37:35.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If someone were to tell you this ship was headed for Singapore...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:39.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:41.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I would say they're full of it, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.89,0:37:46.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we turned southwest last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.63,0:37:48.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.73,0:37:52.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're not looking for trouble.   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.57,0:37:55.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're looking for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.34,0:38:00.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.41,0:38:04.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going to find Skull Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:08.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Find it, film it, and show it to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:12.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For 25 cents, you get to see the last blank space on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.39,0:38:15.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.89,0:38:19.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.26,0:38:22.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seven years ago, me and Mr. Hayes were working our passage...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.93,0:38:24.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,on a Norwegian bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:27.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We picked up a castaway. We found him in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:29.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He'd been drifting for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.57,0:38:32.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His ship had run aground on an island way west of Sumatra.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:36.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,An island hidden in fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:40.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He spoke of a huge wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.81,0:38:43.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,built so long ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.08,0:38:46.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,no one knew who'd made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.35,0:38:49.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A wall 100 foot high...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.52,0:38:52.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,as strong today as it was ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.13,0:38:56.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why'd they build the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.57,0:39:04.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, the castaway, he spoke of a creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.67,0:39:06.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,neither beast nor man...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.27,0:39:10.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but something monstrous, living behind that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.31,0:39:12.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A lion or a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:16.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A man-eater. That's how all these stories start.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.28,0:39:18.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What else did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:19.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.62,0:39:22.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We found him the next morning. He'd stuck a knife through his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:23.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.89,0:39:26.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellows. You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:30.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Monsters belong in B movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.53,0:39:32.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you find this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.07,0:39:36.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,if you go ashore with your friends and your cameras...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.67,0:39:39.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you won't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.34,0:39:42.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just as long as you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:05.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How long do you expect us to stay out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:13.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're writing a stage comedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.57,0:41:15.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm writing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:23.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why would I write a play for you?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.94,0:41:26.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.32,0:41:30.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.49,0:41:35.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.22,0:41:39.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it's in the subtext.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:43.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I must have missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:50.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not about words.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:36.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Message for you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:56.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.84,0:42:59.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hayes, why are we changing course?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Englehorn, you can't just...   - Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.58,0:43:10.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a warrant out for your arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:12.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.59,0:43:17.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to divert to Rangoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.39,0:43:24.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Another week. I haven't got a film yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:28.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. I have risked everything I have on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:32.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Denam. You risked everything I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.01,0:43:35.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.34,0:43:37.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you want. I'll give you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.68,0:43:39.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you off my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.15,0:43:44.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Set a course for Rangoon, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.29,0:43:52.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.23,0:43:56.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over for me, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.83,0:44:00.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How'd you think this would end, Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.05,0:44:19.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Check our position. Use the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.13,0:44:35.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There are no stars, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:39.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:43.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - That.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.15,0:44:48.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:52.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. What is it? A coffee stain?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.95,0:46:34.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Station the forward lookout and get me the depth by lead line.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.09,0:46:36.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.87,0:46:49.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,30 fathoms, no bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:54.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Reduce speed, steerage way only.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.57,0:46:57.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dead slow ahead, both.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:02.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You should stop the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.85,0:47:05.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,15 degrees port.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:10.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.32,0:47:12.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll find clear conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.13,0:47:14.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have seabed!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.40,0:47:21.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,25 fathoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.77,0:47:25.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're shallowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.30,0:47:26.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,20 degrees starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.74,0:47:28.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, you don't know where the hell you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.87,0:47:30.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me another reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.75,0:47:35.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Another reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.88,0:47:39.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,22 fathoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.15,0:47:43.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Douse the lights.   - Aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.23,0:47:56.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,10 fathoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.21,0:48:11.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wall! There's a wall ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.27,0:48:29.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:34.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me some power! Half astern both.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.93,0:49:37.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Half astern both, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.61,0:49:42.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.91,0:49:47.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.65,0:49:53.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rocks to starboard, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.32,0:49:56.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To port! Rocks everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.86,0:49:58.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take the wheel, hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.61,0:50:16.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.30,0:50:41.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Full ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.47,0:50:49.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rocks to port, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.34,0:50:53.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Turn, Captain!   - Starboard, starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.56,0:51:13.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.53,0:52:22.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shore up that breach!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me more men down here now! Come on, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:29.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hayes!   - She's taken a pounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.08,0:52:33.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the prop?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.58,0:52:35.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The shaft's not bent, as far as we can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.85,0:52:38.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But she struck hard against the rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.08,0:52:40.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.99,0:52:42.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Better come up quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.62,0:52:46.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.84,0:53:02.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Want me to bring them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.58,0:53:05.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about Carl Denam.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.34,0:53:08.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want this ship fixed and ready to float on the next high tide!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.91,0:53:10.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.72,0:53:13.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're leaving, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.13,0:53:23.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.53,0:53:28.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got our picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.02,0:54:28.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why does Marlow keep going up the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.10,0:54:32.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.53,0:54:37.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a part of him that wants to, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.70,0:54:41.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A part deep inside himself that sounds a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.68,0:54:45.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But there's another part...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:48.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.88,0:54:54.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To defeat the thing which makes him afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.59,0:54:59.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"We could not understand because we were too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.76,0:55:01.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and could not renenber...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.03,0:55:05.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,because we were traveling in the night of first ages...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:08.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,of those ages that are gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,leaving hardly a sign, and no nenories.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:16.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We are accustoned to look...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.78,0:55:19.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,upon the shackled forn of a conquered nonster...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.41,0:55:23.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but there...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:29.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,there you could look at a thing nonstrous and free."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.06,0:55:41.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not an adventure story...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.87,0:55:43.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is it, Mr. Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.50,0:55:46.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.94,0:55:49.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.83,0:56:14.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's deserted.   - Of course it's deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.30,0:56:17.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Use your eyes, Preston. The place is a ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.17,0:56:21.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody's lived here for hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.85,0:57:38.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Denam, I think we should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.42,0:57:40.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.59,0:57:47.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. Chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.46,0:57:50.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You like chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.96,0:57:54.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.97,0:57:58.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.24,0:58:05.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.22,0:58:15.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, put it in your hand and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.66,0:58:24.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For God's sakes, Denam, leave the native alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.16,0:58:26.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want the chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.43,0:58:29.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.69,0:58:53.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.42,0:58:55.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a bunch of women and old folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.73,0:58:59.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're harmless!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.11,1:00:22.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.67,1:01:50.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.98,1:02:06.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Seen enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.23,1:02:15.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lighten the ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.39,1:02:20.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything that's not bolted down goes overboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.40,1:02:23.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just heave it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.44,1:02:25.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta be grateful for that, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.54,1:02:31.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about Mike? He didn't get away! He's still there!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.01,1:02:35.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mike died doing what he believed in! He didn't die for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.38,1:02:39.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you something else. I'm gonna finish this film for Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.89,1:02:47.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll finish it...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.43,1:02:51.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'll donate the proceeds...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.43,1:02:54.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to his wife and kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.67,1:02:58.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because that man is a hero, and he deserves nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.07,1:03:00.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hear, hear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.94,1:03:41.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Chuck everything except for the potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.88,1:03:49.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong now?   - Excuse me, Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.22,1:03:52.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, men! Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.84,1:04:07.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop those spare cables overboard! Go on, just chuck it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.66,1:04:26.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Ann?   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Ann?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.43,1:04:34.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:55.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's free!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.89,1:05:04.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Full ahead, both engines!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.77,1:05:13.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.29,1:05:38.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Turn back!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.03,1:05:41.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.17,1:05:44.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.17,1:05:46.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They've taken Ann.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.25,1:06:02.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kong! Kong! Kong!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.53,1:06:48.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All hands going ashore! Report to stations!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.73,1:06:52.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jump to it! Jump to it, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.84,1:06:57.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're doing it, Mr. Hayes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.88,1:07:06.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.67,1:07:25.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull harder!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.67,1:07:28.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Row! Row!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.77,1:07:29.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.79,1:08:17.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.30,1:10:42.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Spread out! Find her!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.91,1:10:52.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.48,1:10:55.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Check up there, Jimmy!   - Everybody stay together!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.72,1:10:59.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.89,1:11:03.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.36,1:11:10.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What in God's name was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.57,1:11:18.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behind the wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.90,1:11:20.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behind the wall!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.50,1:12:26.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.91,1:12:34.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You saw something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.75,1:12:44.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can take hayes and 15 others.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.26,1:12:48.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll put a guard on the gate until you return.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.09,1:12:50.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The rest of you stay with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.69,1:12:51.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Choy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:55.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.23,1:12:57.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mr. Hayes. Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.43,1:12:59.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,None of them knows which way to point a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.27,1:13:00.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.11,1:13:03.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Miss Darrow needs me!   - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.45,1:13:10.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring the tripod and all of the film stock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.88,1:13:13.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna go with the 6-inch lens?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:16.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The wide-angle will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.19,1:13:25.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got guns. You got food. You got the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.60,1:13:27.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you got 24 hours!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.87,1:13:29.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,24 hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.53,1:13:31.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This time tomorrow, we haul anchor.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.16,1:13:56.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.06,1:14:00.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.60,1:14:05.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.91,1:14:14.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.73,1:14:34.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.04,1:14:45.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.11,1:14:48.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.65,1:14:51.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.45,1:14:53.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.61,1:15:26.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay down, damn it. Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.16,1:15:44.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:18.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good shooting, Mr. Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.61,1:16:25.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Arert these things supposed to be extinct?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.14,1:16:26.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They are now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.32,1:16:34.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of a place is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.50,1:16:51.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.61,1:16:57.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.22,1:18:14.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.94,1:18:34.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ann!   - Miss Darrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.75,1:18:43.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.26,1:19:33.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Christ, it's a bleeding boneyard!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.07,1:19:37.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They've been ripped limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.37,1:19:41.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann! Ann!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.05,1:19:57.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just keep walking, Mr. Hayes. Pretend you didn't see me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.39,1:19:59.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jesus, Jimmy. Hey,   - I need that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.46,1:20:00.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.76,1:20:02.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You were younger than me when they gave you one!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.86,1:20:06.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was in the Army. I was trained. I had a drill sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.90,1:20:10.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna help bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.87,1:20:19.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't make me regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.17,1:20:49.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Conserve your ammunition!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.51,1:21:00.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm knackered.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.32,1:21:04.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I gotta have a breather.   - Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.45,1:21:05.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fellows, we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.99,1:21:08.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We've lost too much ground already. Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.52,1:21:11.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not about to quit on you. Cut them some slack.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.09,1:21:14.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, you got five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.66,1:21:16.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody stay in sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.60,1:21:24.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here. I'm gonna get a wide shot of the valley.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.27,1:21:55.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bloody Nora!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.78,1:22:05.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that what took Miss Darrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.58,1:22:12.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's only one creature capable of leaving a footprint that size.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.16,1:22:21.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The abominable snowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.66,1:22:25.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a snowman. We dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.07,1:22:28.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's got to be what, 20, 25 feet?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.57,1:22:32.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.41,1:22:34.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.01,1:22:38.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Denam!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.78,1:22:42.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.27,1:23:04.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Walk forward, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.57,1:23:06.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - You're the star of this picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.44,1:23:09.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get into character and head toward the animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.65,1:23:18.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of a place is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.46,1:23:30.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Denam?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:33.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't we have a stand-in for this type of thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.43,1:23:36.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I need you in the shot, or people will say they're fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.44,1:23:38.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna think these are fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.31,1:23:49.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're making them nervous. No sudden movements.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.38,1:23:50.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.46,1:23:58.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.75,1:24:22.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.34,1:24:49.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it? What is it? Where's Carl?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.88,1:24:52.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl? He's up there, filming.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.12,1:25:04.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bugger this!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.93,1:25:13.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.54,1:25:19.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy Christ. Go, Jimmy, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.97,1:25:21.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.35,1:25:29.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let go!   - I'm not leaving the camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.02,1:25:31.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.38,1:25:33.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.67,1:25:47.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.77,1:25:49.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.12,1:26:41.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.95,1:27:46.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.65,1:27:48.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.06,1:28:32.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.97,1:28:38.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up! Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.32,1:28:55.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Denam! Mr. Denam!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.69,1:28:59.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Herb! Herb, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.36,1:29:01.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take the tripod!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.33,1:29:02.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.76,1:29:06.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm pulling you up! Hold on to your end!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.40,1:29:07.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.50,1:29:09.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not going anywhere without you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.87,1:29:12.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You gotta leave me!   - Shut up and hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.27,1:30:22.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, do a head count.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.08,1:30:24.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to know how many are injured and how bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.68,1:30:25.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Injured?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.35,1:30:29.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Four of us are dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.82,1:30:37.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.02,1:30:40.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to herb is no one's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.19,1:30:43.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, Preston.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.00,1:30:46.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.47,1:30:48.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Herbert didn't die for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.17,1:30:51.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He died for what he believed in, and I'm gonna honor that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.04,1:30:56.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He died believing there was still some mystery left in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.58,1:30:59.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we could all have a piece of it...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.38,1:31:01.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for the price of an admission ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.15,1:31:05.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God damn it, Preston, we're gonna finish this film for herb.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.25,1:31:07.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll finish it...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.02,1:31:10.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and donate the proceeds to his wife and kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.20,1:31:20.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. We need more rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.37,1:31:24.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, we gotta get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.44,1:31:26.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Englehorn sails in nine hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.44,1:31:28.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So? We gotta find Miss Darrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.21,1:31:30.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hear me? We're gonna be stranded here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.68,1:31:36.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Darrow was a great gal, no question.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.55,1:31:38.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And she was a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.35,1:31:41.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a terrible loss and we're all gonna miss her.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.89,1:31:45.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I always knew you were nothing like the tough guy you play on screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.86,1:31:47.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just never figured you for a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.66,1:31:49.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal! Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.33,1:31:52.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Heroes don't look like me, not in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.87,1:31:56.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In the real world, they got bad teeth, a bald spot, and a beer gut.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.50,1:32:00.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just an actor with a gun, who's lost his motivation.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.47,1:32:02.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.21,1:32:05.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.11,1:32:09.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, see you.   - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.78,1:37:06.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.68,1:37:09.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.59,1:37:20.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's all there is. There isn't any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.57,1:39:45.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get them off the boat. Get them off the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.67,1:39:49.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep paddling.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.11,1:40:28.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.22,1:41:11.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Get them out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.39,1:41:14.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Preston!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.90,1:41:21.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.03,1:41:23.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.61,1:41:29.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.68,1:41:36.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Choy! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.18,1:41:38.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Swim, you filthy bugger.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.29,1:42:48.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Choy!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.69,1:42:51.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.79,1:42:53.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Swim to shore as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.29,1:42:54.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Preston!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.19,1:42:57.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, don't let go of the camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.40,1:42:59.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let go of the camera!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.81,1:43:09.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up out of that water.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.01,1:43:11.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.56,1:43:53.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.31,1:44:07.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Preston. Preston.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.03,1:44:20.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.48,1:44:40.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you get that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.87,1:45:42.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.98,1:45:44.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.51,1:45:49.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.97,1:46:41.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.87,1:46:47.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.74,1:46:53.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If anything happens, I want you to run.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.85,1:46:55.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.68,1:46:58.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not a coward. I ain't gonna run.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.19,1:47:02.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not about being brave, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.78,1:47:31.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.85,1:47:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Back across the log!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.46,1:47:38.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I ain't gonna run!   - Get Jimmy out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.26,1:47:39.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No!   - Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.75,1:48:01.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! No!   - Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.72,1:48:04.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.06,1:48:11.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.59,1:48:16.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let him go!   - You got to run, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.33,1:48:21.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.04,1:48:24.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go with Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.87,1:48:27.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.48,1:48:33.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No!   - Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.45,1:48:36.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.50,1:48:54.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.42,1:49:14.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.49,1:49:20.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lumpy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:24.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bloody hell, Choy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.05,1:54:47.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.29,1:54:52.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.95,2:01:29.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.77,2:02:19.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.98,2:02:26.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy. Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.45,2:02:28.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.55,2:02:30.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.67,2:03:21.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.42,2:04:16.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off! Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.76,2:04:24.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.68,2:04:39.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.71,2:05:46.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.92,2:06:00.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.38,2:06:22.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it off my face!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.08,2:06:25.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stay still.   - I am standing still.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.99,2:06:29.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hold on.   - Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.62,2:07:07.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move! Stay away from the walls!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.93,2:07:09.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.90,2:07:20.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of there now! Climb!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.58,2:07:29.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.48,2:07:34.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jimmy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.35,2:07:36.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up the rope. Let's go. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.35,2:08:05.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.89,2:08:11.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.16,2:08:16.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.07,2:08:23.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just as you go down...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.00,2:08:26.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for the third and final time...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.41,2:08:30.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,as your head disappears beneath the waves...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.94,2:08:33.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and your lungs fill with water...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.78,2:08:35.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,do you know what happens in those last precious seconds before you drown?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.58,2:08:37.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,do you know what happens in those last precious seconds before you drown?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.15,2:08:41.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy. Get up the rope. Come on. Get out of here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.09,2:08:43.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your whole life passes before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.86,2:08:46.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And if you've lived as a true American...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.59,2:08:48.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you get to watch it all in color.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.83,2:08:51.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, and you will.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.50,2:08:54.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, why don't you climb up the rope, huh? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.50,2:09:01.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Driscoll. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.31,2:11:57.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.30,2:12:20.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.12,2:12:33.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.87,2:13:22.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.14,2:13:26.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.30,2:13:28.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't thank God. Thank Mr. Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.37,2:13:30.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He insisted on a rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.68,2:13:35.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me? I knew you'd be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.45,2:13:38.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the thing about cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.78,2:13:42.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times you flush them down the toilet...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.29,2:13:44.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,they always crawl back up the bowl.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.72,2:13:48.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy? I'm out of the bowl.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.33,2:13:51.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm dryir off my wings and trekkir across the lid.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.94,2:14:01.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Driscoll!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.64,2:14:06.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool! Give it up. It's useless!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.58,2:14:08.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.75,2:14:13.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.22,2:14:19.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack's gonna bring her back...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.43,2:14:23.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and the ape will be hard on his heels.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.73,2:14:26.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can still come out of this thing okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.87,2:14:30.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,More than okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.67,2:14:33.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.30,2:14:36.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a boat full of chloroform we could put to good use.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.08,2:14:38.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna trap the ape?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.82,2:14:47.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.02,2:14:51.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you do? Live animal capture?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.96,2:14:54.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard you were the best.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.83,2:15:03.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.04,2:15:08.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look after yourself!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.44,2:15:11.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep the gate open, will you?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.44,2:15:12.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.88,2:15:15.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.49,2:15:29.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.72,2:18:09.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.32,2:19:19.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.29,2:19:21.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.69,2:19:53.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack, Jack!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.03,2:20:02.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.24,2:20:13.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.04,2:20:16.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, let's go. Let's go. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.73,2:20:31.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.83,2:20:33.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.32,2:22:06.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.59,2:22:09.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please! Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.43,2:22:12.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They've gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.47,2:22:16.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl. Christ.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.10,2:22:18.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.04,2:22:21.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop the bridge. Do it now, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.27,2:22:22.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.94,2:22:25.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.71,2:22:26.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.95,2:22:32.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.76,2:22:43.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.47,2:23:57.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now! Throw them!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.04,2:23:59.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Throw!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.30,2:24:01.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.71,2:24:04.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold him!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.01,2:24:06.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.22,2:24:17.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stop!   - Hold the line!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.09,2:24:19.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep him down!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.06,2:24:26.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Heave!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.10,2:24:28.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.90,2:24:30.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.93,2:24:31.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.00,2:24:34.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No.   - Get her out of...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.34,2:24:36.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- They'll kill him!   - There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:36.31,2:24:38.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No!   - Get her out of his sight!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.34,2:24:40.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's too late.   - Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.55,2:24:43.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.95,2:24:47.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.56,2:24:53.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.76,2:24:54.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on.   - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.03,2:24:56.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.73,2:24:59.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, please come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.57,2:25:08.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Kill it!   - No. No!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.61,2:25:10.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over, you goddamn lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:13.08,2:25:14.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All of you, run!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.68,2:25:16.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:45.68,2:25:47.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.68,2:25:51.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.96,2:26:01.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stay there!   - It's me he wants!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.66,2:26:03.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Please stop this!   - Move! Hold onto her!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.93,2:26:06.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann, go. Please, I can stop this!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.66,2:26:08.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Ann, stay there!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.67,2:26:12.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.81,2:26:16.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:16.74,2:26:18.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on!   - Jimmy, don't be crazy! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.81,2:26:20.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.31,2:26:22.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.75,2:26:25.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cast off!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.52,2:26:28.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Carl!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.25,2:26:32.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Row!   - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.36,2:26:34.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Row, God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.74,2:26:45.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.78,2:26:53.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.88,2:27:01.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:18.97,2:27:20.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Don't! Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.87,2:27:22.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hide out in the back!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.96,2:27:46.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait!   - No!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.30,2:27:49.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No! Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:48.12,2:29:50.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The whole world will pay to see this.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.39,2:29:55.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're millionaires, boys!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.69,2:29:57.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll share it with all of you!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.43,2:30:02.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In a few months his name will be up in lights on Broadway!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.10,2:30:09.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kong! The Eighth Wonder of the World!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.50,2:31:14.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What can I say? What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.60,2:31:16.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Any comments, Mr. Denam?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:17.34,2:31:18.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Mayor, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.18,2:31:21.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.34,2:31:22.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What am I?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.08,2:31:24.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.65,2:31:30.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.35,2:31:31.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's great to see you. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.09,2:31:33.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm really appreciating that...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.62,2:31:35.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at you! I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.16,2:31:38.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're a lucky guy, Denam.   - Am I a lucky guy?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.23,2:31:40.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're the lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.84,2:31:55.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carl!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.88,2:31:58.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Zelman! I told them.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.15,2:31:59.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you did and I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:59.68,2:32:01.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get a shot of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.15,2:32:03.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.02,2:32:06.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Big smile. Yeah! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.73,2:32:11.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself. Look at what you've becone.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.66,2:32:14.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No woman is won'th this.   - This woman is won'th it.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.00,2:32:16.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it takes, I gotta win her back.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.07,2:32:18.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.37,2:32:20.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's not gonna buy this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.10,2:32:22.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up and hand me the grapefruit!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.44,2:32:27.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're writing a conedy?   - Yes, I an.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.84,2:32:29.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm writing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:31.72,2:32:33.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.58,2:32:36.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would I write a play for you?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.39,2:32:42.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.29,2:32:43.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:45.03,2:32:46.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but overhear.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.40,2:32:53.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So, he took me to this fancy French restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.20,2:32:56.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and halfway through the hors d'oeuvres, he clutches my hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.07,2:32:58.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And that's when he told you how he felt?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:58.34,2:33:01.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. He never said it.   - He never said it?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.14,2:33:03.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He probably thought he didn't need to say it.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:03.18,2:33:05.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then how does she know that it's real?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.28,2:33:08.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He said it was not about the words.   - Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:08.95,2:33:13.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you feel it, you say it. It's really very simple.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.46,2:33:17.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He said we'd talk about it later. Only there was no later.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:19.50,2:33:21.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It never happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.07,2:33:23.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's how it ended.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.97,2:33:27.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He just let you walk away? He didn't try to save it?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.57,2:33:32.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I honestly believed things might actually work out...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:34.04,2:33:36.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,which was really very...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.32,2:33:40.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,foolish.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:40.78,2:33:43.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Men. Oh, they'll give you the world...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.49,2:33:45.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but they let the one thing that truly matters...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:45.96,2:33:47.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,slip through their fingers.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.92,2:33:49.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.76,2:33:51.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're so busy being brave,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.52,2:33:53.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,they forget to use their brains.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.40,2:33:56.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Romance. Who needs it?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.02,2:34:22.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.19,2:34:24.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.50,2:34:28.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.63,2:34:32.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.80,2:34:35.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.87,2:34:39.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here to tell you a very strange story.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.14,2:34:41.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The story of our adventure...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.71,2:34:45.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,in which 17 of our party suffered horrible deaths...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.65,2:34:48.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,their lives lost...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.92,2:34:51.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,in pursuit of a savage beast...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.19,2:34:54.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,a monstrous aberration of nature.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.03,2:34:58.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But even the meanest brute can be tamed.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.90,2:35:01.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, ladies and gentlemen, as you will see...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.67,2:35:03.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the beast was no match...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.93,2:35:05.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for the charms of a girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:08.97,2:35:10.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A girl from New York...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.78,2:35:15.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who melted his heart...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:16.28,2:35:18.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,bringing to mind that old Arabian proverb...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:20.82,2:35:23.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"And lo, the beast looked upon the face of beauty...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.02,2:35:26.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and beauty stayed his hand.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.22,2:35:32.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And from that day forward, he was as one dead."
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.87,2:35:43.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And now, ladies and gentlemen, I'm going to show you...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.47,2:35:46.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the greatest thing your eyes have ever beheld.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.61,2:35:52.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a king in the world he knew, but he comes to you now a captive.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.48,2:35:55.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.22,2:35:59.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I give you Kong, The Eighth Wonder of the World!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.13,2:36:12.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be alarmed. It's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:12.57,2:36:16.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,These chains are made of chrome steel!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.76,2:36:38.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Observe, if you will...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.83,2:36:43.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am touching the beast.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.10,2:36:48.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am actually laying my hand on the 25-foot gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.48,2:36:57.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Crank 'em up, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.43,2:37:18.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And now, we have in the auditorium tonight...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.70,2:37:20.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,a surprise guest.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.14,2:37:23.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The real-life hero of this story.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.74,2:37:26.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The man who hunted down the mighty Kong!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:27.84,2:37:32.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The man who risked all to win the freedom of a helpless female.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:33.78,2:37:36.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A big hand for Mr. Bruce Baxter!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.99,2:37:44.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:44.73,2:37:45.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:13.59,2:38:15.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was right.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:16.59,2:38:19.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,About there still being some mystery left in this world...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.56,2:38:22.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and we can all have a piece of it...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.23,2:38:25.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for the price of an admission ticket.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:27.07,2:38:29.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the thing you come to learn about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.47,2:38:34.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His unfailing ability to destroy the things he loves.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:49.33,2:38:51.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please remain calm, ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:52.00,2:38:55.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for we now come to the climax of this savage ritual.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:55.50,2:38:57.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The sacrifice of a beautiful young girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:58.77,2:39:02.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behold her terror as she is offered up to the mighty Kong!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.64,2:39:07.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A big hand, folks, for the bravest girl I've ever met!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.44,2:39:09.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Ann Darrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.69,2:39:59.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Save me from the beast!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:08.30,2:40:09.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.68,2:40:14.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.15,2:40:17.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's Ann?   - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:17.78,2:40:21.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard he offered her all kinds of money and she turned him down flat.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:21.25,2:40:25.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Pack up all ny cares and woe. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.72,2:40:29.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Here I go. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:30.49,2:40:32.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ singing low. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:34.43,2:40:36.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Bye bye. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.87,2:40:40.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Blackbird. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:45.54,2:40:49.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Where sonebody waits for ne. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.31,2:40:52.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ sugar's sweet. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.35,2:40:56.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ so is he. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.45,2:41:00.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Bye bye. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.29,2:41:04.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Blackbird. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.00,2:41:08.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,here's your story, boys.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.40,2:41:11.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Beauty and the man who saved her from the beast."
Dialogue: 0,2:41:17.24,2:41:18.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:26.58,2:41:28.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to get these people out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:28.52,2:41:30.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone needs to leave, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:32.26,2:41:34.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let him roar. It makes a swell picture.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.29,2:41:37.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Head for the exits.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.39,2:41:39.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your own seat, buddy. You're not having mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:48.00,2:41:49.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, fellows.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.17,2:41:52.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Coming through. Coming through, fellows.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.45,2:41:59.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get me down! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.85,2:42:04.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:08.16,2:42:10.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:14.80,2:42:16.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.29,2:43:53.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There they are. Come on, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:06.54,2:44:08.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go!   - Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:09.11,2:44:10.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:17.49,2:44:18.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:26.53,2:44:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.11,2:44:37.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.01,2:45:19.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Taxi! Follow that ape.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:19.75,2:45:21.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal, we gotta draw him off.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:21.32,2:45:23.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all yours, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:45:39.57,2:45:41.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Better get out of here, lady!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:02.02,2:46:03.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.44,2:46:13.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:14.77,2:46:17.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.79,2:46:36.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out.
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.45,2:47:00.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.24,2:52:24.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:52:27.74,2:52:28.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:52:44.19,2:52:45.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.59,2:52:48.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is New York City, and this is sacred ground.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.86,2:52:50.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:50.77,2:52:53.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was built for humans, by humans.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:53.54,2:52:56.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not for stinking lice-infested apes.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:56.24,2:52:58.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The thought of sone nutant gorilla...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:58.14,2:53:02.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,crapping all over the streets of this fair city, fills ne with disgust.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:02.75,2:53:04.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So this is how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.78,2:53:07.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We find it. We kill it.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.45,2:53:11.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We cut its ugly head off and we ram it up...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:30.77,2:53:32.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:03.89,2:56:05.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:11.67,2:56:12.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:56:15.37,2:56:16.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:13.34,3:01:14.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:14.74,3:01:16.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody past this point.
Dialogue: 0,3:01:17.61,3:01:19.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:20.58,3:01:21.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:23.68,3:01:24.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:28.08,3:01:30.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get back. You're not allowed up there!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:30.42,3:01:32.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's going on?   - Go!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:13.98,3:05:15.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.44,3:05:18.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:25.59,3:05:28.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:28.59,3:05:29.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,3:08:26.40,3:08:28.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ann. Ann.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:18.02,3:09:19.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Move along.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:19.79,3:09:21.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just one shot! One shot!
Dialogue: 0,3:09:22.36,3:09:24.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come, come!   - Boys, how about a photo?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:24.53,3:09:25.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:25.63,3:09:27.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, watch the camera.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:30.20,3:09:31.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:32.40,3:09:34.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it, folks. Show's over. Step back!
Dialogue: 0,3:09:34.67,3:09:36.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Clear the area. That's it. Shove off, boys.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:37.57,3:09:39.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:39.44,3:09:41.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Climb up there and get himself cornered.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:41.98,3:09:44.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The ape must have known what was coming.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:44.38,3:09:47.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's just a dumb animal. Didrt know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:53.25,3:09:55.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What does it matter? Airplanes got him.
Dialogue: 0,3:09:58.56,3:10:00.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It wasrt the airplanes.
Dialogue: 0,3:10:04.90,3:10:07.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was beauty killed the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:43.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,《金刚》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:17.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我正坐在世界的顶端 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:23.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 是的 在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:27.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我正退离尘世的阴霾 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:30.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我唱着一首歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:33.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 是的 唱一首歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:36.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 多美妙 哈里路亚   我曾跟牧师说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:39.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿 牧师 是时候召唤了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:40.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 就像蛋人那样 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我要摔跟头了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:48.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我坐在世界的顶端 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:51.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 不想要个几百万 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:59.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我有自己的财产 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我只有一套西装 就一套 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 这是我所有能穿的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:06.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 一捆钞票 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:09.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 不会让我感到快乐 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:11.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 一点甜甜的蜂蜜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:15.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 就可以让我说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:19.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我正坐在  坐在世界的顶端 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.50,0:02:25.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:30.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我正退离  退离尘世的阴霾 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:32.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我唱着一首歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:35.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 是的  唱一首歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:38.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 多美妙 哈里路亚    我曾跟牧师说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:41.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿 牧师 是时候召唤了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 就像蛋人那样 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:45.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我要摔跟头了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:50.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 是啊 我正坐在世界的顶端 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 在摇摆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:09.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个喷嚏挺滑稽  是不是比以前的滑稽一些?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:11.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,令人捧腹  曼尼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:12.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只要我们还在笑...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就不会为了票房而哭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:15.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说到沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:19.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,20个姑娘头顶羽毛冠  象马戏团的小马一样昂首阔步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:21.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那才真叫令人沮丧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢好的合唱团
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.73,0:03:25.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(《隔绝》 杰克·德里斯库著)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么?  - 是出话剧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁写的  安妮?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个叫德莱斯库的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:33.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,德莱斯库
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,联邦剧院的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:38.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别太挑剔了  亲爱的  至少还有观众看他们的戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:42.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会好起来的  不是吗  曼尼?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,总是会好起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:49.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:53.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,窍门是从喉咙后部开始酝酿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从鼻子打出来也挺不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你今天吃东西了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是很饿  不用担心我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:04.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:07.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  带我去吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:12.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:16.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,第三街上的餐厅现在还没关门吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤和饼干  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(剧院无限期关闭 等候进一步通知)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(安·丹劳 哈里·汉克尔 联合出演《公园漫步》现已取消)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哈里  这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:32.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿  开门  我们在这里上班  - 不用再来了  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对你来说是没什么  可是我们两个星期没发工资了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们拿什么去吃饭?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:40.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们不能就这么跑了!  - 他们已经跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:46.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,演出完了  结束了  完结了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:48.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也完结了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要走了  安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:56.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要回芝加哥去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:58.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:01.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起  安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从你小时候开始人们就不断让你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:10.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在得为自己想想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该去试试那个角色
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:18.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  我知道你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:22.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,每当你去争取一样心爱的东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,命运之手就将它从你面前夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这一次不会的  安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:30.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这一次不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦  你好  威斯顿先生  - 噢  上帝!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:40.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  小姐  我已经跟你说过了  给我办公室打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:42.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把你的简历给我的秘书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:45.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以面谈的情况下  我还有必要那么做吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为一个聪明的女孩子会那么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:50.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可我已经把简历给你了  你没有打开就退回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我能怎么办?杰克·德里斯库对演员是非常挑剔的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:55.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求你  就一次试镜而已  这是我所有的请求
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝啊  你不会放弃的  是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:57.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,威斯顿先生  我对那个角色烂熟于胸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:00.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃  太糟了  我们刚把那个角色给了别人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  孩子  这出戏已经满员了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道现在生计艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想听我的建议吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:14.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,用用你的本钱  你长得不难看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这样的女孩子不至于挨饿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:22.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有个新地方  刚刚开业
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在听着  公主殿下  这地方可不是什么宫殿  明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:33.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,找肯尼·凯  就说是我叫你去的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:37.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把戏做好  把钱拿到手...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,然后忘记你曾经去过那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:12.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有多长?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:14.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有五盘胶片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开灯!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这个?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:28.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆  就是这花了我们四万美元?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:29.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的另一部冒险电影?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你向我们许诺说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:33.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会有布鲁斯·巴克斯特和玛琳·麦肯济的浪漫场面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,少来了  伙计们  你们清楚我们的协议
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都同意用玛琳的第一次约会做卖点...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那样她就可以给她的牙整形了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是原则的问题  是钱的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  你已经开拍两个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:46.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我  只要一上船...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:48.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯和玛琳就会开始在银幕上大放光彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么船?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是我们租的  要载我们去目的地的那条船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么目的地  卡尔!你本应该在布景上拍的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的  我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:01.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们  不过我们现在不拍那部电影了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:02.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你们为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,故事改变了  剧本改写了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真实的生活介入了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:11.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我得到了一份地图
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:15.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一座连海图上都没有的小岛  唯一一份现存的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:18.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个被认为只在神话里存在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喂  卡尔  慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是要更多的钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是让我们掏钱赞助竹篮打水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:30.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我所说的是一个原始世界  从没有人见过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:35.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个完整文明的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:39.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们所见过的最壮观的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:42.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那里才是我的片场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那会有奶子吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,奶子?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:52.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,颤动的乳房  煽情的镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,根据我的经验  大家都是奔着...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:59.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,土著姑娘的裸体去看这种电影的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是白痴吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:04.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会问德米尔  他会不会浪费时间在裸体镜头上?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会的  他们尊重电影工作者!他们是有品味的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:11.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然不会明白  贱种!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:18.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能不能出去一会儿  卡尔?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,索尔曼联合公司
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:33.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把那个给我  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:37.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会喜欢的  这里面没有酒精
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:41.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿  关于电影工业你还有很多东西要学!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:46.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要把他打入冷宫  伙计们  毫无疑问他是头脑发热...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:49.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过卡尔·丹汉姆还是拍过一些很有趣的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他有很多作品都...接近成功
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:54.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个自我标榜的自大狂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:58.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他有野心  但是没有才华  全身都透着失败
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:09:59.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以理解你的失望...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他根本不会导演  他根本没那个脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:04.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他算是完蛋了  地球人都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个跳梁小丑会让我们破产的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些关于动物的样片能卖出价钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然  环球公司非常想要资料片镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就卖了它  取消拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得从这次惨败中收回点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他进来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要剧组人员和船员一小时内上船
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不  卡尔  你不能这么干
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉他们制片方催我们提早出发
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是不合法的  - 你想怎么着?告我  嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他们排队去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会让他们就这样砍掉我的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知不知道船上现在一件摄像设备都没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:46.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没有许可  没有签证
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我雇你的理由  普雷斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没有保险  没有外国货币
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上我们什么货币也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:53.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 进去!  - 谁来付船的费用?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:56.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,进去!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:03.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你给我出来!出来!  - 踩油门!踩油门!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:06.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚出来!你完了  丹汉姆!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心  这样的场面我见的多了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,以恶制恶  这个我最拿手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,80度的红牌威士忌...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:21.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,装在标记"柠檬水"的箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:22.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:24.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉玛琳  她可没有六个小时的时间化妆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:27.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果她想演这部电影的话  她就得上船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:30.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她不想演这部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 玛琳不干了  - 她不干了?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,昨天的事  我告诉你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是跟她说我们要在新加坡拍  对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是这么跟她说的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:43.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道  可我们不在新加坡拍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:48.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的  普雷斯顿  你只需要看着她的眼睛扯个谎就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我得找个电话  和哈劳的经纪人谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:52.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哈劳没有空档
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,梅那·罗伊?克莱儿·波?梅·韦斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她哪能穿得下4号衣服?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:12:01.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你得找个能穿玛琳的戏服的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:04.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,菲是穿4号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:08.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错  可她现在正拍着一部雷电华公司的片子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:11.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,库珀是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:15.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你根本没听我说  我们得推迟计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,暂停拍摄  今晚我们走不了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:21.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没门!卡尔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了我能找到那个女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上  普雷斯顿  你需要有成功者的思维方式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:28.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给杰克打电话  我需要那个该死的剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:32.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,失败永远只是暂时性的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:48.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(仅限成人)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:23.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(艳舞秀 所有座位25美分)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!你要为这个付钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:12.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士  我想你掉了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,歌舞杂耍  是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我参与过一回  观众非常挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不尽快搞定他们  他们就会搞定你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:30.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:35.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是习惯于接受陌生人施舍的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或者换句话说...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿不属于我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才显然是可怕的误解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我已经很长时间没有拿到过工资了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:47.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太糟了  不管怎样  安... 我可以称呼你安吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:53.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有没有什么可能  你是穿4号的衣服?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不  不  上帝  不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:00.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你完全误会我了  丹劳小姐  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本不是你想象的那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么你是哪种人?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:07.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你可以信任的人  安  我是个电影制片人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:11.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我  我和那些低级趣味绝对不是一个档次  请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:19.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  我要你想象...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个前往远东的英俊探险家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.89,0:15:28.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们要在远东拍摄?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在船上  他遇到了一个神秘的女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她迷人  纤弱  心神不宁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她无法摆脱这样一种感觉  一种她无法控制的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:46.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在将她推向一段不归路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:50.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就好像她的前半生都只是这一刻的序幕...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:56.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这改变了一切的  宿命的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:00.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,理所当然地  有违她理性的判断...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她坠入了爱河
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:06.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但她对这段感情并没有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她甚至不能确定  她是不是相信真爱的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:12.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果她爱上一个人  命中注定是没有结局的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:20.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,美好的事物从来都是短暂的  丹汉姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:28.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么你是感兴趣的  好  这个就算说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:31.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想催你  但是我们在时间方面比较紧迫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:33.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呃  我真的...  - 安!跟你说吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是最完美的人选  看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最悲情的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:41.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能让他们哭泣  安  你能让他们心碎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看  丹汉姆先生  这就是你搞错的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的工作是让人们笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你的电影好运
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:55.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  丹劳小姐  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会付你给钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:17:00.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冒险  名誉  值得一生回味的经历  还有海上的长途旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.61,0:17:01.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要看剧本的话?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:04.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们谈话的同时  杰克·德里斯库正要交稿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克·德里斯库?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:09.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然  怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  你认识他?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  不认识  我看过他的剧作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:18.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出色的作家  对吗?我告诉你吧  安...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:21.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克·德里斯库可不希望随便什么人来演他的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:22.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他对我说:“卡尔...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:26.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有个女孩子是为了这个角色而生的”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一看到你  就明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明白什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个女孩子只可能是你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我还欠你多少?  - 25美分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,零钱不用找了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的摄影船?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不完全是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:02.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上是这边的这艘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(冒险号)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:15.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要被表面现象蒙蔽了  船上实际宽敞许多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这就是所有设备?  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:20.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 全都在这里了?  - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:21.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们带上"贝灵巧"影像设备了吗?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:24.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好  你拿了所有的镜头?  - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:26.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 卡尔?  - 我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上船吧  伙计们  快  - 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不好了  不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:35.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们正在路上  我刚刚听说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:37.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁?  - 穿制服的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:39.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,电影公司叫了警察
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安格霍恩!解缆!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,升帆  起锚...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,随便你怎么办  我们得出发了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:50.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在等舱单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等谁?请说英语  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,必须的文件  丹汉姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在走的话我再给你一千
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开始的一千你还没有给呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:05.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能不能以后再说?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:08.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没看见我们有贵宾在这里吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:17.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是安·丹劳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么你准备好这次旅行了  丹劳小姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,紧张吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,紧张?不紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:34.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问?我应该紧张吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是每个女人都愿意冒这样的险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:43.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不让我来领丹劳小姐去她的舱位呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:46.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好主意  谢谢  普雷斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐  如果您不介意...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:54.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨  我叫普雷斯顿  卡尔的助手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说好了两千  你收支票吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有其他选择吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你有任何需要... 借过一下  伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:08.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你有任何需要  请尽管开口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:29.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  上帝!杰克  你吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:33.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  如果有任何人来敲门  别开  你也从来没有见过我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就说我得了抑郁症自杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说我把头浸在了马桶里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想来点吗?  - 不行  卡尔  我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:45.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个排练  已经迟到三个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:48.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么?  - 剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是剧本?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:55.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克  只有15页
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.95,0:20:58.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道  可它们都很精彩  你拿到了精彩的15页  卡尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:00.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可是要拍一部全长的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.72,0:21:03.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你原来跟我说还有更多时间的  抱歉  我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:05.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不行  杰克  你不能这么对我  我有了开端...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:07.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可我需要经过和结局  我得有东西可拍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:11.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  你有我的注释  我得走了  朋友  回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:18.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好  好吧  你也许想了结一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:21.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要付我钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会让朋友吃亏的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:28.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我从来不知道你还会主动给人钱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两千怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:34.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:37.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太好了  - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉起缆绳!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,注意船尾!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:53.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  你...你写的是"两千"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛  抱歉  我们从头再写一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:07.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"贰仟美元"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:17.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今天是29号  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,少来  是25号  是25号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝  真抱歉  只需要多花点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:24.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,行了  卡尔  等你回来再付我钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.81,0:22:26.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.59,0:22:42.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特先生  您的舱位在左手边最后一间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:47.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请允许我表达对您回到我们中间的兴奋之情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:49.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,省省吧  帮把手好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我得... 我必需要下...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:55.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:58.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你的帮助  伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:23:00.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来给您开门
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:03.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到您的客房  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,双机极低速前进  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:13.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长  双机微速前进
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:22.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  该死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:45.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在告诫你  杰克  在剧院是赚不到钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  不  不
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.19,0:23:53.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好还是来干电影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:56.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  我干这个不是为了钱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我碰巧爱上了剧院
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:02.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不  你并不爱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.47,0:24:05.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你真爱的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:07.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才就跳下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:13.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是你!这都是你的错!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:30.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里非常舒适的  有充足的昏黄光线  新鲜的干草
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.83,0:24:32.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天  这下面装的是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:35.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,狮子  老虎  河马  应有尽有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卖给动物园吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:39.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,动物园  马戏团
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:42.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长卖珍稀动物赚了不少钱哪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.74,0:24:45.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心  地板上有骆驼尿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.05,0:24:47.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,擦不掉的污迹
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:53.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长可以抓到你想要的任何动物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要白犀牛的话他可以给你个好价钱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老崔!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:02.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没能给您提供舱位我非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,找到符合您品味的笼子了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:07.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么选都烂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.60,0:25:10.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您是什么呢  德里斯库先生?狮子?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.40,0:25:13.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还是黑猩猩?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.61,0:25:16.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就要这一间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:27.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(氯仿)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.19,0:25:30.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你要锁起来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:34.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起  船长  兰皮说...  - 这里不是兰皮发号施令!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.53,0:25:37.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要干什么?想要整船人都睡着吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.90,0:25:42.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把它们搬走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.23,0:26:09.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(主演: 布鲁斯 巴克斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:11.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(亚马逊部落新娘)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.77,0:26:20.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 厨师的特别奉献  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:28.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  上帝  俺的神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:31.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,羊脑配核桃味汁
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.69,0:26:37.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:40.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你照我说的把绳子绕在甲板上了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:42.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在就去  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:46.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先把德里斯库先生的钢笔还给他怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.11,0:26:55.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他没有恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.98,0:26:57.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:26:59.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不会让他再来了  - 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.88,0:27:02.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他很喜欢这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:05.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里也是四年以前我发现他的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:08.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,装在后面的一个笼子里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:11.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,胳膊两处骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:15.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他比这里一半以上的动物还要野
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:19.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在都不肯告诉我他从哪里来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.47,0:27:22.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不管是哪  那绝对不是什么好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.27,0:27:27.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你得搞搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:28.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.51,0:27:32.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会想后半辈子都待在这条船上的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:34.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想的  - 不  你不想的  吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:37.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要聪明一点  受点教育
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给自己多点选择  你要认真对待!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.59,0:27:41.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有啊  赫斯先生  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:43.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经在读书了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:47.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你从哪里搞到的?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:49.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟别人借的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.32,0:27:51.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(纽约市公立图书馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:54.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,长...长期借阅
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.27,0:27:56.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看  看  看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.77,0:28:00.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,, 《不定期货船上的冒险》  瞧见了吗?就跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.11,0:28:09.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你太高兴了  德里斯库先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:13.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上我很熟悉你的作品  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.29,0:28:20.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好  德里斯库先生  很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.59,0:28:23.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上我相当熟悉你的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:25.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你的忠实崇拜者
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.87,0:28:27.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我读过你写的所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.87,0:28:29.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太过了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:33.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,整段对白里都有船的引擎噪声
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海鸥
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:38.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,摄影机的噪音、风声  上帝才知道还有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:39.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管  麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:42.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是音响师  你来搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:46.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!快进来  我来给你介绍剧组里的其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是赫伯  摄影师
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.36,0:28:52.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很荣幸认识你  女士  - 我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这裙子真是太美丽了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:57.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这件旧衣服?我只是随便穿穿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:29:00.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是玛琳的戏服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.67,0:29:04.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃  女孩子要做点什么才能吃到早饭呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:06.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,兰皮  你听到女士说的话了?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:10.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想尝尝我的麦片粥吗?里面还有核桃仁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:16.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢  安  我相信你还不认识...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.19,0:29:20.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:23.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系  丹汉姆先生  我知道这位是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.16,0:29:32.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你诚惶诚恐  非常荣幸能参与演出
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.04,0:29:38.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实际上我非常熟悉你的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:40.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.37,0:29:43.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对  我最崇拜的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.51,0:29:47.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你捕捉普通人声音的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.38,0:29:50.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛  我的工作就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.09,0:29:55.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信以前也有人这么说过  德里斯库先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:56.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话  我想说...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.02,0:30:00.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你和照片上一点也不象
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.23,0:30:06.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  - 等等  安...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.00,0:30:09.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,本人看起来年轻的多  也帅得多
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:11.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  别说了  别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.57,0:30:13.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道  我只是担心你或许是...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:16.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是那种自恋的"作家"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.11,0:30:18.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  我不是...  - 你知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.58,0:30:22.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那种只会把头埋在书本里...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:29.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,见到你也很高兴  丹劳小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  上帝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.00,0:31:12.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她站在栏杆边
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:14.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她还不知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:19.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他们正向灾难驶去  写下来了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.47,0:31:21.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好  那么她转过身来...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大副向她摇晃着走来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:28.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刀从他的背后直透前胸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:31.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等  我们要把大副干掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.89,0:31:34.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们首先得假设她知道大副是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.15,0:31:36.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,少来了  杰克  这只是个真实的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.06,0:31:39.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安是个近视眼  谁都有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.69,0:31:41.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在开玩笑  卡尔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.36,0:31:44.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,关键在于她非常害怕  她向别处看去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.37,0:31:49.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在这时她看到了它
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:53.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.31,0:31:55.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.95,0:32:02.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个岛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:10.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在要到某个岛上去拍摄?什么时候决定的事?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:13.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘘  杰克  小点声
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:16.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想要船员毛骨悚然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.23,0:32:20.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么他们会毛骨悚然?岛叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.33,0:32:22.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  那个岛有个当地的名字...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.44,0:32:24.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我警告你  杰克  它可不怎么好听
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.04,0:32:27.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们叫它骷髅岛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.87,0:32:29.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:31.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方有什么问题?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:34.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个地方没有什么经官方证实的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.68,0:32:38.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为从技术角度讲  它还没有被发现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.45,0:32:42.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:46.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我们就到了这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.38,0:33:04.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,骷髅岛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:12.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  上面的人注意  开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.69,0:33:17.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,实在太让人兴奋了  我以前从来没坐过船
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.42,0:33:20.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前从没坐过有女人的船
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:23.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你们在船上不太会想女人  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.93,0:33:25.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  他们太麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.67,0:33:27.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽量不给你们添麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.67,0:33:29.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在我们周围就已经是麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.61,0:33:38.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:41.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.28,0:33:45.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯  演得非常好  你可以放松10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.59,0:33:48.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,表演非常自然  我都被感动了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.62,0:33:52.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样  德里斯库?对白现在不那么生硬了  对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.19,0:33:54.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是完全的感情流露啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.09,0:33:55.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我加了点善意的嘲弄而已
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还是克制这种冲动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:00.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是一点幽默感罢了  朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:02.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是什么?布尔什维克吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.97,0:34:04.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,演员哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.30,0:34:08.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,踏遍整个世界  却只能看到一面镜子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.09,0:34:22.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.09,0:34:26.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是晕船的意思 呃  你知道  晕船
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.36,0:34:33.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是说你没有漂亮的腿  只是不小心说出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:36.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝啊  丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.34,0:34:40.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今天你和布鲁斯的那场戏...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.94,0:34:42.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你不是那么写的...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:46.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可巴克斯特先生强烈地认为如果一个男人喜欢一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.51,0:34:49.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么他一定要忽视她的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.25,0:34:52.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果敌意真的变得很深...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:54.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.25,0:34:55.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个有趣的理论
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.69,0:34:58.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道  我应该...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:01.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这并非我本意  不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:02.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:04.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你做了自己的诠释
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:07.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我当时好紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.43,0:35:10.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 当时很滑稽  实际上  - 你当时是很滑稽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.00,0:35:13.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托别再说下去了  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.37,0:35:14.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.41,0:35:22.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不用紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.15,0:36:34.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.39,0:36:37.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们再...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:39.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你可不可以... 我们这儿正在拍  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.49,0:36:41.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:42.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的  再来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:59.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们快到了  转向西南
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.88,0:37:03.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,西南方向上千英里内都没有陆地
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.98,0:37:07.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们离正常航线越来越远
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.59,0:37:10.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能摸黑在这片水域行驶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.12,0:37:13.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.66,0:37:16.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那里什么也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那样的话  你也不会失去什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.88,0:37:35.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有人对你说  这条船没有驶向新加坡...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:39.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会怎么说?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:41.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会说千真万确  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.89,0:37:46.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上我们转向西南了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.63,0:37:48.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们  拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.73,0:37:52.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不想找麻烦  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.57,0:37:55.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在找别的什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.34,0:38:00.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对  你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.41,0:38:04.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要找到骷髅岛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:08.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,找到它  拍摄下来展示给整个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:12.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只要花25美分  你就可以看到地图上最后的空白
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.39,0:38:15.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道那是不是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.89,0:38:19.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.26,0:38:22.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,七年前我和赫斯先生一起工作在...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.93,0:38:24.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一艘挪威帆船上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:27.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们从水中救起了一个海难的幸存者
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:29.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他已经漂了很多天了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.57,0:38:32.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的船在一个岛上搁浅了  在苏门答腊以西很远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:36.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一座隐藏在迷雾中的岛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:40.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说起一道巨大的城墙...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.81,0:38:43.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,建于久远的年代...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.08,0:38:46.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人知道是谁建造了它
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.35,0:38:49.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,墙高100英尺...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.52,0:38:52.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在仍然和建成时一样坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.13,0:38:56.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要建一道墙呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.57,0:39:04.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个幸存者  他说起一个生物...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.67,0:39:06.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,既非野兽  也非人类...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.27,0:39:10.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但的确有可怕的生物  就活在那座墙后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.31,0:39:12.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一头老虎或者狮子?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:16.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或者是吃人的家伙?所有故事都是这么开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.28,0:39:18.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他还说什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:19.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么也没说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.62,0:39:22.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,第二天早晨我们发现他的心脏上插了一把刀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:23.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呣
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.89,0:39:26.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉  伙计们  编故事编好点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:30.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怪兽  只在B级电影里才出现
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.53,0:39:32.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你找到这个地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.07,0:39:36.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你和你的朋友们还有你们的摄像机一起上岸的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.67,0:39:39.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们就永远也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.34,0:39:42.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是想要你们明白这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.17,0:40:08.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(迷雾)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:05.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为我们会在这里待多长时间?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:13.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在写一出舞台喜剧?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.57,0:41:15.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我为你而写的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:19.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:23.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么我要为你写一出戏?  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.94,0:41:26.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这还不明显吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.32,0:41:30.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说不是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.49,0:41:35.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.22,0:41:39.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在潜台词里已经说明了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:43.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那我一定是没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:50.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是言语上的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.05,0:42:36.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给你的  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:56.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出什么事情了?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.84,0:42:59.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫斯  我们为什么要改变航向?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.24,0:43:03.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安格霍恩  你不能...  - 外面说!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.58,0:43:10.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的逮捕证已经下发了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:12.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.59,0:43:17.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经下命令转驶向仰光了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.39,0:43:24.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再给我一个星期  我的电影还没有拍成
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:28.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你  我把我的一切都押上了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:32.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不  丹汉姆  你把我的一切都押上了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.01,0:43:35.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.34,0:43:37.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我你想要什么?我什么都可以给你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.68,0:43:39.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要你下船
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.15,0:43:44.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,设定到仰光的航向  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.29,0:43:52.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.23,0:43:56.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说结束了  杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.83,0:44:00.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为会有怎样的结局呢  卡尔?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.05,0:44:19.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,检查一下我们的位置  用星星
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.13,0:44:35.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,天上没有星星  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.70,0:44:39.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.07,0:44:43.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么东西?  - 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.15,0:44:48.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个  就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:52.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道  是什么?也许是咖啡渍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.95,0:46:34.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,守好前方观望台  告诉我测深索的深度
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.09,0:46:36.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.87,0:46:49.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,30英寻  没见底!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:54.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,减速  只用低速
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.57,0:46:57.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,双机低速前进
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.48,0:47:02.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该停船
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.85,0:47:05.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,左舵15度
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:10.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫斯先生  我们会走出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.32,0:47:12.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会找到没有雾的区域的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.13,0:47:14.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,测到海底了!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.40,0:47:21.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,25英寻!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.77,0:47:25.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,水越来越浅了!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.30,0:47:26.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,右舵20度!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.74,0:47:28.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长  你根本不知道你正驶向哪里!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.87,0:47:30.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再去读个深度!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.75,0:47:35.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再读一次深度!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.88,0:47:39.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,22英寻!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.15,0:47:43.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把灯关掉  - 是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.23,0:47:56.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,10英寻!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.21,0:48:11.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,城墙!正前方有堵墙!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.27,0:48:29.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,关闭发动机!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:34.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我点动力!半速前进!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.93,0:49:37.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,半速前进  船长!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.61,0:49:42.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,礁石!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.91,0:49:47.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,礁石!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.65,0:49:53.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,右舷有礁石  船长!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.32,0:49:56.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,左舷也有礁石!到处都是礁石!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.86,0:49:58.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你来掌舵  赫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.61,0:50:16.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.30,0:50:41.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,全速前进!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.47,0:50:49.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,左舷有礁石  船长!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.34,0:50:53.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 躲过了  船长  - 右弦!右弦!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.56,0:51:13.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.53,0:52:22.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把这个洞堵上!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我找更多人下来!来吧  快点  快!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:29.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 赫斯!  - 船被狠狠撞了一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.08,0:52:33.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,推进器怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.58,0:52:35.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如我们现在所知  主轴没弯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.85,0:52:38.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们卡在礁石上了!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.08,0:52:40.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,船长!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.99,0:52:42.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好快点上来!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.62,0:52:46.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在那儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.84,0:53:02.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想让我带他们回来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.58,0:53:05.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔·丹汉姆关我屁事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.34,0:53:08.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下次涨潮之前要把这条船修好!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.91,0:53:10.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点  加油干!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.72,0:53:13.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要走了  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.13,0:53:23.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能相信吗  杰克?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.53,0:53:28.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的电影拍成了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.02,0:54:28.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么马洛非要逆流而上呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.10,0:54:32.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他为什么不回头?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.53,0:54:37.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有一个"他"想要那么做  吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.70,0:54:41.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他心底有个声音在发出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.68,0:54:45.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是那另一个"他"...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.91,0:54:48.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,需要去探索个究竟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.88,0:54:54.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好打败那让他恐惧的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.59,0:54:59.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"我们过去无法理解  因为我们身在遥远的彼方...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.76,0:55:01.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也早已淡忘...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.03,0:55:05.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那旅行是穿过史前时代的长夜...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:08.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而那时代早已远去...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,了无踪迹  也没有回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:16.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经司空见惯了...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.78,0:55:19.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带着沉重枷锁的被征服的巨兽...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.41,0:55:23.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但在那里...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.28,0:55:29.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在那里你会见到一个凶残并且无拘无束的它"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.06,0:55:41.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是个冒险故事...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.87,0:55:43.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对吗  赫斯先生?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.50,0:55:46.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对  吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.94,0:55:49.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.83,0:56:14.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是个荒废了的地方  - 这当然是个被荒废的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.30,0:56:17.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛看看  普雷斯顿  这地方就是个废墟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.17,0:56:21.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,成百上千年没有人住过了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.85,0:57:38.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆先生  我想我们该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.42,0:57:40.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个我来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.59,0:57:44.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(牛奶巧克力)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.59,0:57:47.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看  巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.46,0:57:50.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你喜欢巧克力吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.96,0:57:54.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.97,0:57:58.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想要吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.24,0:58:05.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.22,0:58:15.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里  拿在手里吧  拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.66,0:58:24.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上  丹汉姆  别跟这些土著纠缠了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.16,0:58:26.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她不想要你的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.43,0:58:29.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.69,0:58:53.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.42,0:58:55.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只是女人和老人!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.73,0:58:59.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有危险的!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.11,1:00:22.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.67,1:01:50.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.98,1:02:06.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这下开眼了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.23,1:02:15.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给船减轻重量!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.39,1:02:20.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是必需的东西都扔下去!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.40,1:02:23.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,举起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.44,1:02:25.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得心存感激  先生们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.54,1:02:31.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那麦克呢?他可没逃出来  他现在都还在那儿呢!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.01,1:02:35.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,麦克死得其所!他的死不是没有价值的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.38,1:02:39.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我再告诉你一件事  我会为了麦克把这部电影拍完的!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.89,1:02:47.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把它拍完的...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.43,1:02:51.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我还要把影片的收益捐给...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.43,1:02:54.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的妻子和孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.67,1:02:58.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为那人是个英雄  他应该得到这样的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.07,1:03:00.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听啊  听!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.94,1:03:41.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,除了土豆  把能扔的都扔掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.88,1:03:49.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这到底是怎么了?  - 抱歉  莎士比亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.22,1:03:52.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  老兄  来吧  快点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.84,1:04:07.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把那些多余的缆绳扔掉!快啊  扔掉!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.66,1:04:26.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安在哪里?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.43,1:04:34.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:55.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,脱离困境了!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.89,1:05:04.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,双机全速前进!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.77,1:05:13.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.29,1:05:38.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!停船!回去!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.03,1:05:41.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停船!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.17,1:05:44.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须掉头
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.17,1:05:46.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们抢走了安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.25,1:06:02.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚!刚!刚!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.53,1:06:48.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,全体人员准备上岸!报告位置!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.73,1:06:52.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点  快点  先生们!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.84,1:06:57.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正在做  赫斯先生!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.88,1:07:06.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.67,1:07:25.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,用力划!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.67,1:07:28.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,划啊!划啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.77,1:07:29.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,加油!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.79,1:08:17.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.30,1:10:42.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,散开来  找到她!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.91,1:10:52.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.48,1:10:55.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 去那边找  吉米!  - 所有人不要走散了!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.72,1:10:59.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.89,1:11:03.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她应该就在附近!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.36,1:11:10.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝啊  那是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.57,1:11:18.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在城墙后面!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.90,1:11:20.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,城墙后面!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她不见了!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.50,1:12:26.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.91,1:12:34.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你见到什么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.75,1:12:44.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫斯带15个人跟你们去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.26,1:12:48.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我派人守卫城门  直到你们回来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.09,1:12:50.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,其他人在船上等
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.69,1:12:51.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老崔!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:55.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米  你不去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.23,1:12:57.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这样  赫斯先生  看看他们
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.43,1:12:59.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人会用枪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.27,1:13:00.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你呆在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.11,1:13:03.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 丹劳小姐需要我!  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.45,1:13:10.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带上三角架跟其他拍摄设备
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.88,1:13:13.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要六寸长焦镜头吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.78,1:13:16.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,普通广角镜足够了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.19,1:13:25.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有枪、有食物、有弹药
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.60,1:13:27.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给你们24小时!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.87,1:13:29.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,24小时啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.53,1:13:31.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明天这个时候我们启锚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.16,1:13:56.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.06,1:14:00.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.60,1:14:05.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.91,1:14:14.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.73,1:14:34.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.04,1:14:45.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.11,1:14:48.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阻止它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.65,1:14:51.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停火
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.45,1:14:53.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停火!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.61,1:15:26.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下  妈的  趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.16,1:15:44.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊  来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:18.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打的好  赫斯先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.61,1:16:25.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些东西不是绝种了么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.14,1:16:26.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们现在是了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.32,1:16:34.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这他妈到底是什么地方?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.50,1:16:51.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.61,1:16:57.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.22,1:18:14.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.94,1:18:34.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安!  - 丹劳小姐!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.75,1:18:43.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.26,1:19:33.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好家伙  这里好像流着血的坟场
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.07,1:19:37.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们都被分肢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.37,1:19:41.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!安!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.05,1:19:57.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫斯先生  继续走就是了  当没看见我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.39,1:19:59.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 耶稣基督啊  吉米  - 我需要那把枪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.46,1:20:00.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会给你枪的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.76,1:20:02.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们发枪给你的时候比我还小!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.86,1:20:06.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我那是在陆军里  有教练士官教我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.90,1:20:10.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想帮忙找她回来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.87,1:20:19.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要让我后悔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.17,1:20:49.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,节省弹药
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.51,1:21:00.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我都累死了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.32,1:21:04.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不能呼吸了  - 我需要人工呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.45,1:21:05.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们  没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.99,1:21:08.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经延误了  起来吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.52,1:21:11.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们需要休息  放松一下.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.09,1:21:14.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们可以休息5分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.66,1:21:16.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人都要待在我的视线以内
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.60,1:21:24.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到这边来 我要给峡谷拍一个广角
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.27,1:21:55.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,血腥诺拉!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.78,1:22:05.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这东西抓走了丹劳小姐?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.58,1:22:12.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只有一种生物可以留下这么大的脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.16,1:22:21.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怖的雪人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.66,1:22:25.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊  雪人  我们是刀板上的鱼肉了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.07,1:22:28.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那东西得多大  20  25英尺高?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.57,1:22:32.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔看到过
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.41,1:22:34.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们问问他
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.01,1:22:38.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.78,1:22:42.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他跑哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.27,1:23:04.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走过去  布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.57,1:23:06.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你是片子主角
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.44,1:23:09.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,进入角色  走向那群动物
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.65,1:23:18.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里到底是他妈的什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.46,1:23:30.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定这能行吗  丹汉姆?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:33.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这种事没替身的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.43,1:23:36.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你在镜头里  不然别人说这是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.44,1:23:38.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人会说这是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.31,1:23:49.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你让它们紧张了  别突然乱动
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.38,1:23:50.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没动
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.46,1:23:58.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝他妈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.75,1:24:22.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.34,1:24:49.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了  怎么了?卡尔在哪?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.88,1:24:52.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔?他...他在那边  拍电影
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.12,1:25:04.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.93,1:25:13.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑啊  杰克!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.54,1:25:19.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,耶稣基督啊  快走  吉米  跑啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.97,1:25:21.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑  跑  跑啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.35,1:25:29.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你放手  - 我不会丢下摄影机的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.02,1:25:31.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快放手  你个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.38,1:25:33.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.67,1:25:47.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.77,1:25:49.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看着点!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.12,1:26:41.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来了!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.95,1:27:46.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.65,1:27:48.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.06,1:28:32.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔!卡尔!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.97,1:28:38.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,起来!快走  快走
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.32,1:28:55.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹汉姆先生!丹汉姆先生!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.69,1:28:59.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫伯  赫伯!快点!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.36,1:29:01.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住三角架!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.33,1:29:02.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.76,1:29:06.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我把你拉上来  抓紧了支脚
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.40,1:29:07.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.50,1:29:09.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不  没你我哪儿也不去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.87,1:29:12.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你应该离开我  - 闭嘴  抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.27,1:30:22.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米  算算人头数
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.08,1:30:24.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道有多少人受了伤  伤势如何
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.68,1:30:25.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,受伤?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.35,1:30:29.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们死了4个人!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.82,1:30:37.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.02,1:30:40.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,发生在赫伯身上的事  不是谁的错
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.19,1:30:43.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的很对  普雷斯顿
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.00,1:30:46.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我再告诉你一件事情
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.47,1:30:48.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫伯没有无谓的死去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.17,1:30:51.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他死得其所  我要纪念他
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.04,1:30:56.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他死是因为相信世界上还有些奥秘
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.58,1:30:59.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而我们大家都有可能了解到其中的一部分...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.38,1:31:01.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只消一张门票的价钱
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.15,1:31:05.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死的  普雷斯顿  我们要为赫伯完成这部片子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.25,1:31:07.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要完成它...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.02,1:31:10.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把收益捐给他的妻子和孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.20,1:31:20.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们  我们还需要更多的绳子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.37,1:31:24.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧  我们得回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.44,1:31:26.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安格霍恩会在9小时后开船
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.44,1:31:28.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那又怎样?我们要找到丹劳小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.21,1:31:30.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!你在听我讲吗?我们会被困在这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.68,1:31:36.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着  伙计们  丹劳小姐是好姑娘  毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.55,1:31:38.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是很好的人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.35,1:31:41.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她的死是可怕的损失  我们都会想念她的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.89,1:31:45.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道你不是银幕上所演的那种硬汉形象
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.86,1:31:47.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是没想到你居然是个懦夫
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.66,1:31:49.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿  伙计  嘿  醒醒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.33,1:31:52.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真实生活里的英雄不像我这样
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.87,1:31:56.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真实生活里他们都有坏牙跟啤酒肚
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.50,1:32:00.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是个拿枪的演员  并且失去了动力
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.47,1:32:02.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.21,1:32:05.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有谁吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.11,1:32:09.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧  回见  - 别...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.78,1:37:06.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.68,1:37:09.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了  不!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.59,1:37:20.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到此为止  没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.57,1:39:45.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赶他们下船!赶他们下船!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.67,1:39:49.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,继续划啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.11,1:40:28.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到底是什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.22,1:41:11.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊  把他们赶跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.39,1:41:14.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.90,1:41:21.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.03,1:41:23.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.61,1:41:29.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.68,1:41:36.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老崔!救命!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.18,1:41:38.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,游啊  你个脏虫子!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.29,1:42:48.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老崔!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.69,1:42:51.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着他
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.79,1:42:53.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尽快游到河岸去!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.29,1:42:54.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住  普雷斯顿!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.19,1:42:57.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么  别丢了摄像机!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.40,1:42:59.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别丢了摄像机!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.81,1:43:09.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  起来  离开水
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.01,1:43:11.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.56,1:43:53.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊  来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.31,1:44:07.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿  普雷斯顿
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.03,1:44:20.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还能用
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.48,1:44:40.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有拍到是吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.87,1:45:42.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.98,1:45:44.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.51,1:45:49.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.97,1:46:41.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.87,1:46:47.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赫斯先生?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.74,1:46:53.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有什么不测  我希望你赶快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.85,1:46:55.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.68,1:46:58.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是懦夫  我才不会跑呢
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.19,1:47:02.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这并非什么勇敢  吉米
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.78,1:47:31.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回去!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.85,1:47:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回去木桥那边!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.46,1:47:38.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不能就这么跑掉!  - 把吉米带走!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.26,1:47:39.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!  - 后退!后退!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.75,1:48:01.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!不!  - 呆着别动
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.72,1:48:04.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.06,1:48:11.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.59,1:48:16.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放他走!  - 你要跑了  吉米
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.33,1:48:21.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,按我说的做
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.04,1:48:24.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟杰克一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.87,1:48:27.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.48,1:48:33.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!  - 开枪射他!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.45,1:48:36.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.50,1:48:54.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里  在这边!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.42,1:49:14.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住!坚持!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.49,1:49:20.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,兰皮!救我!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:24.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他妈的地狱  老崔!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.05,1:54:47.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.29,1:54:52.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  我的神啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.95,2:01:29.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.77,2:02:19.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.98,2:02:26.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米!吉米!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.45,2:02:28.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.55,2:02:30.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.67,2:03:21.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.42,2:04:16.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下去  下去!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.76,2:04:24.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下去!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.68,2:04:39.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下去!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.71,2:05:46.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了它!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.92,2:06:00.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.38,2:06:22.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把它从我脸上弄走
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.08,2:06:25.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 站着别动  - 我没动
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.99,2:06:29.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等一下  - 小心!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.62,2:07:07.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动  离崖壁远点
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.93,2:07:09.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,脱险了!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.90,2:07:20.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在离开那儿!往上爬!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.58,2:07:29.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人能挡我的道
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.48,2:07:34.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  吉米  我们走
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.35,2:07:36.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爬上绳子  快
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.35,2:08:05.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米  我们走了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.89,2:08:11.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快来啊  好的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.16,2:08:16.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.07,2:08:23.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在你下沉...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.00,2:08:26.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到第三也是最后一次时...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.41,2:08:30.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在你的头淹没在浪头下...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.94,2:08:33.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的肺也充满了水...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.78,2:08:35.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在你淹死前
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.58,2:08:37.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道那仅存的珍贵的几秒钟都发生了什么嘛?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.15,2:08:41.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  兄弟  爬上绳子去  来啊  离开这  来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.09,2:08:43.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的整个人生会在眼前一幌而过
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.86,2:08:46.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而如果你活得像个真正的美国人...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.59,2:08:48.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会看到那是有色彩的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.83,2:08:51.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  你会的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.50,2:08:54.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在  你干吗不爬上绳子呢?来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.50,2:09:01.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  德里斯库  我们走
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.31,2:11:57.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真美丽
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.30,2:12:20.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,美丽
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.12,2:12:33.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,美丽
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.87,2:13:22.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.14,2:13:26.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.30,2:13:28.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别谢上帝  要谢巴克斯特先生
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.37,2:13:30.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他坚持要救你们
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.68,2:13:35.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我?我就知道你不会有事
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.45,2:13:38.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是蟑螂的特点
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.78,2:13:42.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你把它们从厕所里冲走多少次...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.29,2:13:44.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它们总是爬回到碗里来
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.72,2:13:48.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿  伙计  我从碗里出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.33,2:13:51.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在晾干我的翅膀  正沿着碗盖散步呢
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.94,2:14:01.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,德里斯库!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.64,2:14:06.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别犯傻!放弃吧  没用的!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.58,2:14:08.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.75,2:14:13.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她没死
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.22,2:14:19.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克会救她回来...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.43,2:14:23.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那猩猩会紧追不放的
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.73,2:14:26.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还有机会翻本  好吧?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.87,2:14:30.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有的赚
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.67,2:14:33.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想想吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.30,2:14:36.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有一整船的氯仿可用
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.08,2:14:38.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想抓那猩猩
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.82,2:14:47.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不这么想
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.02,2:14:51.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是你拿手的吗  活捉动物
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.96,2:14:54.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说你是最好的
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.83,2:15:03.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.04,2:15:08.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,照顾好你自己!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.44,2:15:11.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把城门开着  可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.44,2:15:12.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题  伙计
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.88,2:15:15.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你好运!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.49,2:15:29.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.72,2:18:09.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.32,2:19:19.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.29,2:19:21.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.69,2:19:53.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克  杰克!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.03,2:20:02.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.24,2:20:13.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  没事的
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.04,2:20:16.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  我们走  我们走  来吧!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.73,2:20:31.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要走了  来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.83,2:20:33.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.32,2:22:06.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.59,2:22:09.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人吗  请帮帮我们!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:11.43,2:22:12.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们走了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.47,2:22:16.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔  上帝啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.10,2:22:18.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.04,2:22:21.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把吊桥放下  现在就放  看在上帝份儿上!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.27,2:22:22.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还不是时候
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.94,2:22:25.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.71,2:22:26.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.95,2:22:32.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等着!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.76,2:22:43.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.47,2:23:57.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就现在!扔钩子啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.04,2:23:59.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,扔啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.30,2:24:01.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.71,2:24:04.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.01,2:24:06.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.22,2:24:17.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 住手!  - 抓住绳子
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.09,2:24:19.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他压住!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.06,2:24:26.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.10,2:24:28.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.90,2:24:30.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要!停手!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.93,2:24:31.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.00,2:24:34.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 住手  - 把她带走...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.34,2:24:36.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们会杀了他的!  - 我们什么也做不了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:36.31,2:24:38.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不!  - 把她带出它的视线!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.34,2:24:40.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太迟了  - 扔啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.55,2:24:43.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,留神啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.95,2:24:47.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.56,2:24:53.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得走了  来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.76,2:24:54.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 住手
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.03,2:24:56.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.73,2:24:59.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  求你  走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.57,2:25:08.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打死它!  - 不要!不!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.61,2:25:10.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,结束了  你个疯子
Dialogue: 0,2:25:13.08,2:25:14.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人  逃命!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.68,2:25:16.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,加油  加油!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:45.68,2:25:47.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跑啊!跑啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.68,2:25:51.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快  快点!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.96,2:26:01.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呆在那!  - 他要的是我!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.66,2:26:03.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 求你制止这一切!  - 快走  拦住她!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.93,2:26:06.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安  走吧  求你  我可以制止他!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.66,2:26:08.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!安  呆在哪儿!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.67,2:26:12.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,离开这儿!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.81,2:26:16.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赶快他妈的离开这儿!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:16.74,2:26:18.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来吧!  - 吉米  别犯傻了!来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.81,2:26:20.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别犯傻了
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.31,2:26:22.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我走!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.75,2:26:25.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,起锚!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.52,2:26:28.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊  卡尔!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.25,2:26:32.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 划船  - 等等
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.36,2:26:34.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,划船  他妈的!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.74,2:26:45.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回去
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.78,2:26:53.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吉米  不!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:00.88,2:27:01.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:18.97,2:27:20.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!别开枪!放他条生路!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.87,2:27:22.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,躲在后面!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.96,2:27:46.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等一下!  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.30,2:27:49.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!求你了!不要!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:48.12,2:29:50.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,全世界都会要付钱看它
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.39,2:29:55.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是百万富翁了  弟兄们!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.69,2:29:57.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会跟你们所有人共享的!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.43,2:30:02.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,几个月之内  它的名字会在百老汇的灯光里出现
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.10,2:30:09.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,金刚!世界第八大奇迹!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:18.22,2:30:20.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(金刚 世界第八大奇迹)
Dialogue: 0,2:30:21.03,2:30:23.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(金刚 卡尔·丹汉姆的巨型怪兽)
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.20,2:30:45.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(看安妮·丹劳被奉献给"野兽")
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.07,2:31:01.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(售完)
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.50,2:31:14.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我能说什么?我能说什么?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.60,2:31:16.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么想法  先生?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:17.34,2:31:18.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,市长大人  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.18,2:31:21.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.34,2:31:22.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是谁?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.08,2:31:24.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.65,2:31:30.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,习惯了就好
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.35,2:31:31.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,非常高兴见到你  你准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.09,2:31:33.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的关心...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.62,2:31:35.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你!我记得你
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.16,2:31:38.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真是好运气  丹汉姆先生  - 可不是好运吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:38.23,2:31:40.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或许你就是个幸运儿
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.84,2:31:55.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡尔!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.88,2:31:58.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,索尔曼!我跟你说了!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.15,2:31:59.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你会来的  我真的很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:31:59.68,2:32:01.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们来照相
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.15,2:32:03.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.02,2:32:06.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大笑一下 耶!这真是太棒了!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.73,2:32:11.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你自己  看看你成了什么样
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.66,2:32:14.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有女人值得你这样  - 这个女人值得
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.00,2:32:16.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管什么代价  一定要赢得她
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.07,2:32:18.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.37,2:32:20.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她才不会买这个呢
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.10,2:32:22.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴  把那个葡萄柚给我
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.44,2:32:27.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在写一部喜剧?  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.84,2:32:29.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是为你写的
Dialogue: 0,2:32:31.72,2:32:33.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.58,2:32:36.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么我要为你写一出戏?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.39,2:32:42.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这还不明显吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.29,2:32:43.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦  对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:32:45.03,2:32:46.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我无意间听到的
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.40,2:32:53.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,于是  他领我去了那豪华法国餐馆...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.20,2:32:56.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吃饭当间  他抓住了我的手
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.07,2:32:58.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他向你表白的时候了吧  他感觉怎样?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:58.34,2:33:01.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不  他一直没说  - 他一直没说吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.14,2:33:03.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他大概以为不用说了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:33:03.18,2:33:05.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那她怎么知道这就是认真的呢?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.28,2:33:08.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他说不必用言语  - 有没有搞错
Dialogue: 0,2:33:08.95,2:33:13.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,心里有感动  就说出来  其实很简单的
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.46,2:33:17.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说以后再说  只是  不会有以后了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:19.50,2:33:21.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从来没有说出口过
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.07,2:33:23.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.97,2:33:27.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他让你就这么走了?他没有试图挽留?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.57,2:33:32.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说  我觉得事情或许真的有结果了...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:34.04,2:33:36.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是真的很...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.32,2:33:40.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,2:33:40.78,2:33:43.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,男人哪  哦  他会给女人整个世界...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.49,2:33:45.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,却让最重要的事情...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:45.96,2:33:47.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,溜过指尖
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.92,2:33:49.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太常见了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.76,2:33:51.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们太忙于展示他们的勇敢
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.52,2:33:53.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,以至于忘了用用他们的脑子
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.40,2:33:56.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,浪漫  谁需要?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.02,2:34:22.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.19,2:34:24.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.50,2:34:28.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.63,2:34:32.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.80,2:34:35.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们  先生们...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.87,2:34:39.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来这里是要给你们讲述一个奇异的故事
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.14,2:34:41.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个有关我们的历险的故事...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.71,2:34:45.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,17名探险队员惨死...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.65,2:34:48.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们献出了自己的生命...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.92,2:34:51.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去追寻一只野兽...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.19,2:34:54.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一只大自然创造的狂大怪物
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.03,2:34:58.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但即使是最难对付的畜生也会被驯服
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.90,2:35:01.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的  女士们先生们  你们将要看到...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.67,2:35:03.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,野兽并不能抵挡...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.93,2:35:05.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个女孩的魅力
Dialogue: 0,2:35:08.97,2:35:10.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个来自纽约的女孩...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.78,2:35:15.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她融化了他的心...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:16.28,2:35:18.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这让我们想起古老的阿拉伯诗句
Dialogue: 0,2:35:20.82,2:35:23.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"看啊  野兽端详着美女的面庞...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.02,2:35:26.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而美女静立于他的掌中
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.22,2:35:32.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从那天开始  他便如行尸一般了"
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.87,2:35:43.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在女士们先生们  我要向你们展示...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.47,2:35:46.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们所见过的最伟大的事物
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.61,2:35:52.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是世界之王  他知道  但它在你们面前则是囚犯
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.48,2:35:55.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.22,2:35:59.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我向你们推出  金刚  世界第八奇迹!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:09.13,2:36:12.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不必惊惶  这是绝对安全的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:12.57,2:36:16.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些锁链是用铬钢做的!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.76,2:36:38.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,敬请观看...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.83,2:36:43.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我手碰到野兽了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.10,2:36:48.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手放在25英尺高的大猩猩身上
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.48,2:36:57.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们  把它拉起来
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.43,2:37:18.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚在观众席中...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.70,2:37:20.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有一位神秘嘉宾
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.14,2:37:23.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,故事里的真正英雄
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.74,2:37:26.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,追猎到强大金刚的人!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:27.84,2:37:32.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冒着生命危险去解救身处绝境的女性的人
Dialogue: 0,2:37:33.78,2:37:36.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为布鲁斯·巴克斯特先生鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.99,2:37:44.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢!谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:44.73,2:37:45.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,2:38:13.59,2:38:15.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说得对
Dialogue: 0,2:38:16.59,2:38:19.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,关于世界上仍有很多奥秘...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.56,2:38:22.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们大家都可以了解到其中的一部分...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.23,2:38:25.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只消一张门票的价钱
Dialogue: 0,2:38:27.07,2:38:29.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在了解卡尔了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.47,2:38:34.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他那无穷无尽破坏他钟爱的事物的能力
Dialogue: 0,2:38:49.33,2:38:51.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们  请保持镇定...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:52.00,2:38:55.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在是这原始的祭祀仪式的高潮
Dialogue: 0,2:38:55.50,2:38:57.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,供奉一位年轻美丽的女孩!
Dialogue: 0,2:38:58.77,2:39:02.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她被献给强大的金刚
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.64,2:39:07.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请为我所见  最勇敢的女孩热烈鼓掌!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.44,2:39:09.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安·丹劳小姐
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.69,2:39:59.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把我从野兽手上救出来!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:08.30,2:40:09.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,救我!
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.68,2:40:14.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.15,2:40:17.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安在哪里?  - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:40:17.78,2:40:21.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说他们出一大笔钱  但她干脆地拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:21.25,2:40:25.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 整理好我所有的烦恼和悲哀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.72,2:40:29.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 我来了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:30.49,2:40:32.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 低声吟唱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:34.43,2:40:36.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 再见 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.87,2:40:40.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 黑鸟 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:45.54,2:40:49.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 是什么地方有个人在等我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.31,2:40:52.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 糖很甜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.35,2:40:56.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 他也一样 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.45,2:41:00.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 再见 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.29,2:41:04.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 黑鸟 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.00,2:41:08.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你们的故事  先生们
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.40,2:41:11.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"美女和从野兽手里拯救他的男人"
Dialogue: 0,2:41:17.24,2:41:18.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:41:26.58,2:41:28.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们赶快把人弄出去
Dialogue: 0,2:41:28.52,2:41:30.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人出去了  走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:41:32.26,2:41:34.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他吼吧  这镜头很精彩
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.29,2:41:37.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,往出口走
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.39,2:41:39.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己买座位  伙计  别打我的主意
Dialogue: 0,2:41:48.00,2:41:49.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,借光  伙计
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.17,2:41:52.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好戏来了  来了  伙计们
Dialogue: 0,2:41:56.45,2:41:59.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,救我下来!救命!求你!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:01.85,2:42:04.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来人啊!来人救救我!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:08.16,2:42:10.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走!走!出去!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:14.80,2:42:16.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走啊!走啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.29,2:43:53.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在那儿!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:06.54,2:44:08.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走啊!  - 等等我!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:09.11,2:44:10.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回去!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:17.49,2:44:18.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走这边!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:26.53,2:44:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,救命!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.11,2:44:37.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,2:45:17.01,2:45:19.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出租车  跟着那只猩猩
Dialogue: 0,2:45:19.75,2:45:21.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  老兄  我们要转移他的注意力
Dialogue: 0,2:45:21.32,2:45:23.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这车是你的了  伙计
Dialogue: 0,2:45:39.57,2:45:41.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿  离开这  女士!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:02.02,2:46:03.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.44,2:46:13.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:14.77,2:46:17.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊!来啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:46:35.79,2:46:36.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当心
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.45,2:47:00.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,耶稣基督啊
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.24,2:52:24.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开火!
Dialogue: 0,2:52:27.74,2:52:28.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,住手!
Dialogue: 0,2:52:44.19,2:52:45.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.59,2:52:48.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是纽约  是神圣的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.86,2:52:50.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你听见我说的了?
Dialogue: 0,2:52:50.77,2:52:53.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是人类建造的  也是为人类建造的
Dialogue: 0,2:52:53.54,2:52:56.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是给长虱子的臭猩猩建的
Dialogue: 0,2:52:56.24,2:52:58.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果一只变种猩猩想...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:58.14,2:53:02.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,踩烂这座美丽城市的每一寸土地都会令我厌恶
Dialogue: 0,2:53:02.75,2:53:04.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以这就是后果
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.78,2:53:07.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找到它  我们就杀了它
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.45,2:53:11.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,砍掉它丑陋的头颅  砸碎它...
Dialogue: 0,2:53:30.77,2:53:32.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!不!
Dialogue: 0,2:56:03.89,2:56:05.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真美丽!
Dialogue: 0,2:56:11.67,2:56:12.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的!
Dialogue: 0,2:56:15.37,2:56:16.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的!很美!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:13.34,3:01:14.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!嘿!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:14.74,3:01:16.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,禁止通行!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:17.61,3:01:19.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能进去!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:20.58,3:01:21.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:23.68,3:01:24.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住他!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:28.08,3:01:30.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿!回来!你不能进来!
Dialogue: 0,3:01:30.42,3:01:32.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事?  - 快走!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:13.98,3:05:15.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:16.44,3:05:18.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:25.59,3:05:28.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求你!不!
Dialogue: 0,3:05:28.59,3:05:29.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,3:08:26.40,3:08:28.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安!安!
Dialogue: 0,3:09:18.02,3:09:19.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走开!
Dialogue: 0,3:09:19.79,3:09:21.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就拍一下  拍一下!
Dialogue: 0,3:09:22.36,3:09:24.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 过来  过来!  - 伙计们  照张相怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:24.53,3:09:25.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,3:09:25.63,3:09:27.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧  看着相机
Dialogue: 0,3:09:30.20,3:09:31.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,站得再近一点
Dialogue: 0,3:09:32.40,3:09:34.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了  伙计们  完事了  退后
Dialogue: 0,3:09:34.67,3:09:36.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,清理现场  就这样  退后  兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,3:09:37.57,3:09:39.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么它要那样?
Dialogue: 0,3:09:39.44,3:09:41.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爬那么高  把自己困住了
Dialogue: 0,3:09:41.98,3:09:44.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,猩猩肯定知道是什么下场
Dialogue: 0,3:09:44.38,3:09:47.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它就是个蠢动物  啥都不懂
Dialogue: 0,3:09:53.25,3:09:55.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么区别?飞机收拾了它
Dialogue: 0,3:09:58.56,3:10:00.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是飞机
Dialogue: 0,3:10:04.90,3:10:07.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是美女杀死了野兽
